hadiths[155]{hadithnumber,text}:
"639","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ham par khutba padha aur farmaya : Ae logon ! tum par Hajj farz hua hai pas Hajj karo aik shakhs ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ! kiya har saal (Hajj karna zaroori hai) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam khamosh ho rahay us shakhs ne teen baar yehi arz kiya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke agar mein haan keh deta to har saal wajib ho jata aur phir tum se na ho sakta pas tum mujhe itni hi baat par chhor do ke jis par mein tumhein chhor dun us liye ke tum se pehle log usi sabab se halaak hue hain ke unhon ne apne Nabion se bohat sawal kiye aur un se bohat ikhtilaf kartay rahay pas jab mein tum ko kisi baat ka hukm dun to us mein se jitna ho sakay amal karo aur jab kisi baat se mana karun to us ko chhor do"
"640","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : aik Umra se doosra Umra kaffara ho jata hai darmiyan ke gunaahon ka aur maqbool Hajj ka badla jannat ke siwa aur kuch nahi hai"
"641","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke jo us ghar (bait Allah) mein aaya aur behooda shahwat raani ki baatein kein aur na gunah kiya wo aisa phira ke goya usay maan ne abhi jana (yani gunaahon se paak ho gaya)"
"642","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne us Hajj mein ke jis mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un ko Hajjat al-Wida se pehle ameer bana kar bheja tha mujhe us jamaat mein rawana kiya ke jo nahr ke din ye pukaartay thay ke us saal ke baad ab koi mushrik Hajj ko na aaye aur na koi nanga ho kar bait Allah ka tawaaf karay (jaisay ayyaam jahiliyat mein kartay thay) bin Shihab Zuhri rahimahullah Allah ne kaha ke Abdur Rahman ke betay Humaid bhi Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ki usi hadees ke sabab se ye kehtay thay ke Hajj Akbar ka din wohi nahr ka din hai"
"643","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Arafa se barh kar koi din aisa nahi hai jis mein Allah Taala bandon ko aag se itna azaad karta ho jitna Arafa ke din azaad karta hai aur Allah Taala (apne bandon ke) qareeb hota hai aur bandon ka haal dekh kar farishton par fakhr karta hai aur farmata hai ke ye kis irada se jama hue hain"
"644","[AI-translation] ´Ali Azdi raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ne unhein sikhaya ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kahein safar mein janay ke liye apne oont par sawaar hotay to teen baar Allah Akbar farmatay phir ye dua padhtay ” paak hai wo zaat jis ne us janwar ko hamaray taabe kar diya aur ham us ko daba na saktay thay aur ham apne Rab ke paas laut janay walay hain } az-Zukhruf : 14,13 { Ae Allah ! ham tujh se apne us safar mein neki aur parhezgaari maango hain aur aisay kaam ka sawal kartay hain jisay to pasand karay Ae Allah ! ham par us safar ko aasaan kar de aur us ki masaafat ko ham par thora kar de Ae Allah to hi safar mein rafeeq safar aur ghar mein nigraan hai Ae Allah ! mein tujh se safar ki takleefon aur ranj o gham se aur apne maal aur ghar walon mein buray haal mein laut kar aanay se teri panah maangta hun (ye to jatay waqt padhtay) aur jab laut kar aatay to bhi yehi dua padhtay magar us mein itna zyada kartay ke ” ham lautnay walay hain tauba karnay walay khaas apne Rab ki ibadat karnay walay aur usi ki tareef karnay walay hain “"
"645","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jo aurat Allah Taala aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhti ho usay ye jaaiz nahi hai ke teen din ka zyada ka safar karay magar jab us ke saath us ka baap ho ya beta ho ya shohar ya bhai ya koi aur rishta daar jis se parda na ho"
"646","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aurat ko aik din ka safar (akelay) karnay se mana farmaya magar jab us ke saath (us ka shohar ya) koi aur mahram rishta daar maujood ho"
"647","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko khutba mein ye farmatay hue suna ke koi mard kisi aurat ke saath akeela na ho magar us soorat mein ke us ka mahram us ke saath ho aur na aurat (akelay) safar karay magar kisi mahram rishta daar ke saath pas aik shakhs khara hua aur kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! meri biwi ne Hajj ko janay ka irada kiya hai aur mera naam falan lashkar mein likha gaya hai (yani mujaahideen mein mera naam likha gaya hai) to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke to ja aur apni biwi ke saath Hajj ada kar"
"648","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat ki ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko oonton par sawaar kuch log (muqaam) Rauha mein milay to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un se poocha ke tum kaun log ho unhon ne kaha ke Musalman tab un logon ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se poocha ke Aap kaun hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mein Allah Taala ka Rasool hun phir aik aurat ne aik bachay ko haathon se buland kiya aur arz kiya ke kiya us ka Hajj sahih hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : haan sahih hai aur us ka sawab tum ko hai (yani maan baap ko)"
"649","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha ke` fazl bin Abbas raziyallahu anhu Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke peechay sawaar thay pas Khasam qabeela ki aik aurat aayi aur wo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam poochnay lagi aur fazl us ki taraf dekhnay lagay to wo fazl ko dekhnay lagi aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne fazl raziyallahu anhu ka munh doosri taraf pher diya gharz us aurat ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ! Allah ne jo apne bandon par Hajj farz kiya hai aur mera baap (itna) boorha hai ke sawaari par sawaar nahi ho sakta kiya mein us ki taraf se Hajj karun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : haan aur ye Hajjat al-Wida ka zikr hai"
"650","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Asma bint Umais ko Muhammad bin Abu Bakr ke paida honay ka nifaas Zul Hulaifa ke safar mein shuru ho gaya to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ko hukm kiya ke un se kahein ke nahayein aur labbaik pukaarein"
"651","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ahl Madina ke liye Zul Hulaifa ko meeqaat muqarrar farmaya aur ahl shaam ke liye Johfa aur ahl Najd ke liye Qarn ul manazil aur ahl Yaman ke liye Yalamlam ko meeqaat farmaya aur ye sab meeqaatein un logon ke liye bhi hain jo un mulkon mein rehtay hain aur un ke liye bhi jo aur mulkon se Hajj ya Umra ki niyyat se wahan aayein phir jo un meeqaaton ke andar rehnay walay hun yani Makka se qareeb to wo wahein se ehraam baandhein yahan tak ke ahl Makka Makka se hi labbaik pukaarein"
"652","[AI-translation] ´Abu Zubair se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) se suna (jab) un se ehraam baandhnay ki jagah ke baaray mein sawal kiya gaya to unhon ne kaha aur mere khayal mein unhon ne ye marfooan bayan kiya ke mein ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Madina walon ke liye ihlaal (ehraam baandhnay ki jagah) Zul Hulaifa hai aur doosra rasta Juhfa hai aur Iraq walon ke liye ehraam baandhnay ki jagah zaat ul irq hai aur Najd walon ke liye Qarn ul manazil hai aur Yaman walon ki Yalamlam hai"
"653","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko un ke ehraam ke liye khushbu lagayi jab ehraam baandha (ehraam baandhnay se pehle) aur un ke halal honay ke liye tawaaf ifaza se pehle"
"654","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` goya mein mushk ki chamak Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki maang mein dekhti hun aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam (us waqt) ehraam mein thay"
"655","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Bani Israil ki aik aurat ka zikr kiya jis ne apni angoothi mein mushk bhari thi aur mushk to bohat umda khushbu hai"
"656","[AI-translation] ´Nafi kehtay hain ke` Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) jab khushbu ki dhooni letay to ood ki letay jis mein aur kuch na mila hota ya kafoor ki (dhooni) letay aur us ke saath ood daaltay aur phir kehtay ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam bhi usi tarah khushbu letay thay"
"657","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jis ko khushboodaar ghaas di jaye ya khushboodaar phool diya jaye to wo us ko radd na karay (yani lenay se inkar na karay) us liye ke us ka kuch bojh nahi aur khushbu umda hai"
"658","[AI-translation] ´Salim bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne apne walid Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se suna wo kehtay thay ke ye Baida tumhara wohi muqaam hai jahan tum log Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par jhoot baandhtay ho aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne labbaik nahi pukaari magar masjid Zul Hulaifa ke qareeb se"
"659","[AI-translation] ´Ubaid bin Juraij se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se kaha ke Ae Abu Abdur Rahman ! mein ne tumhein chaar aisay kaam kartay hue dekha hai jo tumharay saathiyon mein se kisi ko kartay hue nahi dekha unhon ne kaha ke Ae Juraij ke betay ! wo kaun se kaam hain unhon ne kaha ke awwal ye ke mein tumhein dekhta hun ke tum Kaaba ke kaunon mein se (tawaaf ke waqt) haath nahi lagatay ho magar do kaunon ko jo Yaman ki taraf hain doosray ye ke tum sabti jootay pehantay ho teesray ye ke (zafraan o wars waghera se daarhi) rangtay ho chauthay ye ke jab tum Makka mein hotay thay to logon ne chaand dekhtay hi labbaik pukaarna shuru kar di thi magar Aap ne aath Zi Hijja ko pukaari pas Abdullah raziyallahu anhu ne jawab diya ke (suno !) arkaan to mein ne nahi dekha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam un ko chhootay hun siwa un ke jo Yaman ki taraf hain aur sabti jootay to mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekha ke wo bhi aisay jootay pehantay thay jis mein baal na hun aur usi mein wuzu kartay thay (yani wuzu kar ke geelay peer mein us ko pehan letay thay) pas mein bhi us ko dost rakhta hun ke mein bhi usi ko pehanon rahi zardi to mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekha hai ke wo bhi us se rangtay thay (yani baalon ko ya kapron ko) to mein bhi pasand karta hun ke us se rangon aur labbaik to mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko nahi dekha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne labbaik pukara ho magar jab oontni Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko sawaar kar ke uthi (yani masjid Zul Hulaifa ke paas)"
"660","[AI-translation] ´Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha ke` ham Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath ehraam baandhay hue Hajj mufrad ko aaye (shayad un ka aur baaz sahaba ka ehraam aisa hi ho aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam to Qaarin thay) aur Aisha (raziyallahu anha) Umra ke ehraam ke saath aayein yahan tak ke jab (muqaam) Sarif mein pahunche to Aisha (raziyallahu anha) haiza ho gayein phir jab ham Makka mein aaye aur Kaaba ka tawaaf kiya aur Safa aur Marwa ki Sayi ki to hamein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne hukm kiya ke jis ke saath hadi (qurbani ka janwar) na ho wo ehraam khol daalay (yani halal ho jaye) to ham ne kaha ke kaisa halal Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mukammal halal ho jana to phir ham ne ehraam bilkul khol diya rawi ne kaha ke phir ham ne apni auraton se jima kiya khushbu lagayi aur kapray pehnay aur us waqt hamaray aur Arafa mein chaar raaton ka farq baaqi tha phir tarwiya ke din (yani Zilhajja ki aathwin tareekh) ko (Hajj ke liye) ehraam baandha phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ke paas aaye to unhein rotay hue paya to poocha ke tumhein kiya hua hai unhon ne arz kiya ke mein haiza ho gayi hun aur log ehraam khol chukay hain aur mein na to ehraam khol saki na tawaaf kar saki ab log Hajj ko ja rahay hain to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ye to aik cheez hai ke Allah Taala ne Adam ki sab betion par likh di hai pas tum ghusl karo (yani ehraam ke liye) aur Hajj ka ehraam baandh lo to unhon ne aisa hi kiya aur wuqoof ki jagahon mein wuqoof kiya yahan tak ke jab paak huein to bait Allah aur Safa o Marwa ka tawaaf kiya phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum Hajj aur Umra donon se halal ho gayein to unhon ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mein apne dil mein aik baat paati hun ke mein ne tawaaf (yani tawaaf qudoom) nahi kiya jab tak Hajj se farigh na hui to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Abdur Rahman raziyallahu anhu (bin Abu Bakr raziyallahu anhu) ! un ko Taneem mein le ja kar Umra kara lao ye muamla us shab ko hua jab Muhassab mein thehray hue thay"
"661","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab oontni par sawaar hue aur wo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko le kar masjid Zul Hulaifa ke qareeb seedhi khari ho gayi tab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne labbaik farmayi yani ” mein haazir hun Ae Allah ! mein haazir hun mein haazir hun tera koi shareek nahi mein haazir hun beshak sab tareef aur nemat tere liye hai mulk tera hi hai aur tera koi shareek nahi “ unhon ne kaha ke Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay thay ke ye Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka talbiya hai Nafi kehtay hain ke Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) us mein ye kalimaat zyada padhtay thay ke ” mein haazir hun (teri khidmat mein) mein haazir hun (teri khidmat mein) mein haazir hun aur sa'aadat sab teri hi taraf se hai aur khair tere hi haathon mein hai mein haazir hun aur teri hi taraf raghbat karta hun aur amal tere hi liye hai “"
"662","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Hajj aur Umra (donon) ka ehraam baandha aur farmaya ((” labbaik umratan o hajjan “)) yani (Ae Allah) mein haazir hun Umra aur Hajj ki niyyat se haazir hun Umra aur Hajj ki niyyat se"
"663","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mujhe qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki jaan hai bin Maryam alaihissalam zaroor labbaik pukaarein ge ” Rauha “ ghaati mein ya to wo Hajj kar rahay hun ge ya Umra kar rahay hun ge ya phir Hajj aur Umra donon ada kar rahay hun ge"
"664","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` ham ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath Hajj mufrad ki labbaik pukaari aik doosri riwayat mein hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Hajj mufrad ki labbaik pukaari"
"665","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Hajj ifraad kiya (yani sirf Hajj kiya)"
"666","[AI-translation] ´Bakr bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke` Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko Hajj aur Umra donon ki labbaik pukaartay hue suna Bakr ne kaha ke mein ne yehi hadees Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se bayan ki to unhon ne kaha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne sirf Hajj ki labbaik pukaari pas mein Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se mila aur un se kaha ke Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) to yun kehtay hain to Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke tum log hamein bacha samajhtay ho mein ne bakhoobi suna hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay labbaik hai Umra ki aur Hajj ki"
"667","[AI-translation] ´Imran bin Husain (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` ham ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath Hajj tamattu kiya aur us ke baaray mein Quran nahi utra (yani us se nai mein) jis shakhs ne apni raye se jo chaha keh diya (muraad Umar raziyallahu anhu hain ke wo Hajj tamattu se mana kartay thay) { muqaam ghaur hai ke Umar raziyallahu anhu jaisay sahabi ki baat jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki baat ke khilaf thi to sahaba kiraam ne Umar raziyallahu anhu ki baat ka inkar kar diya aur aaj ham aur hamaray ulama (munh se bhalay iqraar na karein lekin amalan) Imamon ki baat ki wajah se Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki baat (ahadees) chhor detay hain Allah Taala ham ko seedha rasta dikhaye aameen }"
"668","[AI-translation] ´Imran bin Husain (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Hajj tamattu kiya aur ham ne bhi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath Hajj tamattu kiya"
"669","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` ham Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath aaye aur ham Hajj ki labbaik pukaartay thay to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne hamein hukm diya ke ham us ehraam Hajj ko ehraam Umra kar daalein"
"670","[AI-translation] ´Musa bin Nafi kehtay hain ke` mein Hajj ke saath Umra ka faida uthanay (Hajj tamattu) ki gharz se yaum tarwiya se chaar roz qabal Makka aaya to logon ne mujhe kaha ke tera Hajj to ahl Makka ka Hajj hai tab mein ne Ata bin Abu Rabah ke paas aaya aur un se masala daryaft kiya to Ata ne kaha ke mujh se Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ne bayan kiya ke unhon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath Hajj kiya jis saal Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath hadi thi (yani Hajjat al-Wida mein us liye ke hijrat ke baad Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aik hi Hajj kiya hai) aur baaz logon ne sirf Hajj mufrad ka ehraam baandha tha to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum ehraam khol daalo aur bait Allah ka tawaaf karo aur Safa o Marwa ki Sayi karo aur baal kam kara lo aur halal raho yahan tak ke jab tarwiya ka din ho (yani aath Zilhajja) to Hajj ki labbaik pukaaro aur tum jo ehraam le kar aaye ho us ko Hajj tamattu kar daalo (yani agarchay wo ehraam Hajj ka hai magar Umra kar ke khol lo aur phir Hajj kar lena to ye Hajj tamattu ho jaye ga) logon ne arz kiya ke ham usay tamattu kaisay banayein halanke ham ne Hajj ka naam liya hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke wohi karo jis ka mein tumhein hukm deta hun us liye ke mein agar qurbani ko saath na lata to mein bhi waisa hi karta jaisa tum ko hukm deta hun magar ye ke mera ehraam khul nahi sakta jab tak ke qurbani apne mehal (yani zabah khana) tak na pahunch jaye phir logon ne usi tarah kiya (jaisa Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne hukm farmaya tha)"
"671","[AI-translation] ´Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Makka ki kankareeli zameen mein oont bithaye hue thay (yani wahan manzil ki hui thi) to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mujh se poocha ke tum ne kis niyyat se ehraam baandha hai mein ne arz kiya ke jis niyyat se Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ehraam baandha hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne poocha ke tum qurbani saath laaye ho mein ne kaha nahi to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : bait Allah aur Safa Marwa ka tawaaf kar ke ehraam khol daalo pas mein ne bait Allah ka tawaaf aur Safa Marwa ki Sayi ki phir mein apni qaum ki aik aurat ke paas aaya (ye un ki mahram thi) to us ne mere sar mein kanghi ki aur mera sar dho diya phir mein Abu Bakr o Umar raziyallahu anhuma ki khilafat mein logon ko yehi fatwa denay laga (yani jo baghair qurbani ke Hajj par aaye to wo Umra karnay ke baad ehraam khol de phir yaum at-Tarwiya 8 Zul-Hajj ko dobara Hajj ka ehraam baandhay lekin) aik martaba mein Hajj ke muqaam par khara tha ke achanak aik shakhs aaya us ne kaha ke (to to ehraam kholnay ka fatwa deta hai) Aap jantay hain ke Ameer-ul-Momineen Umar raziyallahu anhu ne qurbani ke mutaliq naya kaam shuru kar diya (yani Umar raziyallahu anhu ka kehna tha ke Umra kar ke ehraam ko kholna nahi chahiye) to mein ne kaha Ae logon ! ham ne jis ko us masalay ka fatwa diya hai us ko ruk jana chahiye kyunke Ameer-ul-Momineen Umar raziyallahu anhu aanay walay hain lihaza un ki pairwi karo jab Umar raziyallahu anhu aaye to mein ne kaha Ameer-ul-Momineen Aap ne qurbani ke mutaliq ye kiya naya masala bataya hai to Umar raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya : agar Aap Allah ki kitab Quran par amal karein to Quran kehta hai : ((wa atimmu Hajj wal-umrah lillah)) yani Hajj aur Umra ko Allah ke liye poora karo (yani ehraam na kholo) aur agar Aap Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki sunnat par amal karein to un ka apna tareeqa ye tha ke unhon ne ehraam us waqt tak na khola jab tak qurbani na kar li"
"672","[AI-translation] ´Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Hajj tamattu Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke sahaba ke liye khaas tha (Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) ka apna qaul hai hadees Nabawi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam nahi)"
"673","[AI-translation] ´Nafi se riwayat hai ke` Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ayyaam fitna mein Umare ko niklay aur kaha ke agar mein bait Allah se roka gaya to waisa hi karein ge jaisa ke ham ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath mein kiya tha phir Umra ka ehraam kar ke nikal kar chalay yahan tak ke (muqaam) Baida par pahunche (jahan se Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki labbaik aksar sahaba ne Hajjat al-Wida mein suni thi) to apne saathiyon se kaha ke Hajj aur Umra ka hukm aik hi hai ke donon se ihlaal kar saktay hain to mein tum ko gawah karta hun ke mein ne apne upar Umra ke saath Hajj bhi wajib kar liya hai aur chalay yahan tak ke bait Allah pahunch kar tawaaf ke saath saat chakkar lagao aur saat baar Safa aur Marwa ke baich mein Sayi ki us se zyada kuch nahi kiya aur usi ko kaafi samjha aur qurbani ki"
"674","[AI-translation] ´Salim bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke` Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Hajjat al-Wida mein Hajj ke saath Umra mila kar Hajj tamattu kiya aur qurbani ki aur qurbani ke janwar Zi al-Hulaifa se apne saath le gaye thay aur shuru mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Umra ki labbaik pukaari phir Hajj ki labbaik pukaari aur usi tarah logon ne bhi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath Hajj ke saath Umra ka faida uthaya aur logon mein se kisi ke paas qurbani thi ke wo qurbani ke janwar apne saath laaye thay aur kisi ke paas qurbani nahi thi phir jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Makka mein pahunche to logon se farmaya : jo qurbani laya ho wo jin cheezon se ehraam ki wajah se door hai Hajj se farigh honay tak kisi cheez se bhi halal na ho aur jo qurbani na laya ho to wo bait Allah ka tawaaf aur Safa o Marwa ki Sayi kar ke apne baal katar daalay aur ehraam khol daalay phir (aath Zilhajja ko) Hajj ki labbaik pukaaray aur chahiye ke (Hajj ke baad) qurbani karay aur jis ko qurbani mayassar na ho to wo teen rozay Hajj mein rakhay aur saat rozay jab apne ghar pahunche tab rakhay aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab Makka mein aaye to pehle pehal Hajar-e-Aswad ko bosa diya phir saat mein se teen chakkar daur kar lagao aur (jisay ramal kehtay hain) aur chaar baar chal kar tawaaf kiya (jaisay aadat ke muwafiq chaltay hain) phir jab tawaaf se farigh ho chukay to muqaam Ibrahim ke paas do rakatein ada kein phir salam phera aur Safa par tashreef farma hue aur Safa aur Marwa ke baich mein saat baar Sayi ki aur phir kisi cheez ko apne upar halal nahi kiya un cheezon mein se jin ko ba sabab ehraam ke apne upar haraam kiya tha yahan tak ke Hajj se bilkul farigh ho gaye aur apni qurbani yaum un Nehr yani Zilhajja ki das tareekh ko zabah ki aur Makka aa kar bait Allah ka tawaaf ifaza kiya phir har cheez ko apne upar halal kar liya jin ko ehraam mein haraam kiya tha aur jo log qurbani apne saath laaye thay unhon ne bhi waisa hi kiya jaisa Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne kiya tha"
"675","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne kaha ke ham Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath Hajjat al-Wida mein niklay aur kisi ne Umra ka aur kisi ne Hajj ka ehraam baandha jab Makka aaye to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke jis ne Umra ka ehraam baandha hai aur qurbani nahi laya wo ehraam khol daalay aur jis ne Umra ka ehraam baandha aur qurbani laya hai wo na khole jab tak qurbani zabah na kar le aur jis ne Hajj ka ehraam baandha hai wo Hajj poora karay Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke mein haiza ho gayi aur Arafa ke din tak haiza rahi aur mein sirf ne Umra ka ehraam baandha tha to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mujhe Umra chhor kar Hajj ka ehraam baandhnay ka hukm diya kehti hain ke mein ne aisa hi kiya jab Hajj kar chukay to mere saath Abdur Rahman (bin Abu Bakr raziyallahu anhu) ko bheja ke mein Taneem se (ehraam baandh kar) Umra kar aaun wo Umra jis ko mein ne poora nahi kiya tha aur us ka ehraam kholnay se qabal Hajj ka ehraam baandh liya tha"
"676","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` Zubaa raziyallahu anha bint Zubair bin Muttalib Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aayi aur kaha ke mein bhaari boojhal aurat hun aur mein ne Hajj ka irada kiya hai to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam mujhe kiya hukm farmatay hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Hajj ka ehraam baandh lo aur ye shart karo ke Ae Allah ! mera ehraam kholna wahein hai jahan to mujhe rok de (rawi hadees bin Abbas raziyallahu anhuma ne) kaha ke unhon ne Hajj paa liya (ehraam kholnay ki zaroorat nahi pari)"
"677","[AI-translation] ´Ya'la bin Nabiya raziyallahu anhu apne walid se bayan kartay hue kehtay hain ke` aik shakhs Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Jirana mein thay aur wo shakhs aik jubba pehnay hue tha jis par kuch khushbu lagi hui thi ya ye kaha ke zardi ka kuch asar tha us ne arz kiya ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam mujhe Umare ke (tareeqay ke) mutaliq kiya hukm farmatay hain itnay mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par wahi utarnay lagi to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko aik kapra orha diya gaya Ya'la raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke mujhe aarzu thi ke mein Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko us waqt dekhon jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par wahi utarti ho phir kehtay hain ke Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke kiya tum chahtay ho ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekho jabke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par wahi utarti ho phir Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kapray ka kona utha diya aur mein ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam us tarah haanptay aur kharaantay letay thay rawi ne kaha ke mein gumaan karta hun ke unhon ne kaha jaisay jawan oont haanpta ho phir jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se wahi tamam ho chuki to farmaya ke Umra ke baaray mein poochnay wala saail kahan hai (aur farmaya ke) apne kapray waghera se zardi ka ya farmaya ke khushbu waghera ka asar dho daalo aur apna kurta utaar daalo aur Umra mein wohi karo jo Hajj mein kartay ho"
"678","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` aik shakhs ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se poocha ke mahram kapron ki qasam mein se kiya (kaun se kapray) pehnay to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : na kartay pehno na amaamay baandho na paajaamay pehno na baaraan kot orho aur na mozay pehno magar jo chappal na paye wo mozay us soorat mein pehan le ke takhnon ke neechay se kaat daalay aur na aisay kapray pehno jis mein zafraan laga ho ya ” wars “ mein ranga hua ho"
"679","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko khutba detay hue suna ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke paajaama us (mahram) ke liye hai jo tehband na paye aur moza us (mahram) ke liye hai jo na'lain na paye"
"680","[AI-translation] ´Sa'b bin Jasaama al-Laisi raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko aik junglei gadhay ka gosht hadiya diya aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam (muqaam) Abwa ya Dawwaan mein thay to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne wapas kar diya kehtay hain jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mere chehray par malaal dekha to farmaya : ham ne kisi aur wajah se wapas nahi kiya faqat itna hai ke ham log ehraam baandhay hue hain"
"681","[AI-translation] ´Taus Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat kartay hue kehtay hain ke` Zaid bin Arqam raziyallahu anhu aaye to Abdullah raziyallahu anhu ne un ko yaad dila kar kaha ke tum ne shikaar ke gosht ki khabar kaisay di thi jo Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko hadiya diya gaya tha jabke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ehraam baandhay hue thay unhon ne kaha ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko aik uzw shikaar ke gosht ka hadiya diya gaya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne wapas kar diya aur farmaya ke ham log ehraam baandhay hue hain us liye ham nahi khatay"
"682","[AI-translation] ´Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Hajj ke liye niklay aur ham Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath thay Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apne baaz ashaab se farmaya jin mein Qatada bhi thay ke tum saahil behr ki raah lo yahan tak ke mujh se milo phir un logon ne saahil behr ki raah li phir jab wo log Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki taraf phiray to un tamam logon ne ehraam baandh liya siwae Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) ke ke unhon ne ehraam nahi baandha gharz wo raah mein chalay jatay thay ke unhon ne chand wehshi gadhon ko dekha aur Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) ne un par hamla kiya aur un mein se aik gadhi ki koonchein kaat daalein phir un ke sab saathi utray aur us ka gosht khaya Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke ham ne (shikaar ka) gosht khaya aur ham mahram thay kehtay hain phir baaqi ka gosht saath le liya aur jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas pahunche to arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! ham ne ehraam baandh liya tha aur Qatada raziyallahu anhu ne ehraam nahi baandha tha phir ham ne chand wehshi gadhay dekhay aur Qatada ne un par hamla kar ke un mein se aik ki koonchein kaat daalein to ham utray aur ham sab ne us ka gosht khaya aur phir khayal aaya ke ham shikaar ka gosht kha rahay hain aur ehraam baandhay hue hain to us ka baaqi gosht ham letay aaye hain tab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kiya tum mein se kisi ne us ka hukm kiya tha ya us ki taraf ishara kiya tha Qatada kehtay hain ! to unhon ne arz kiya ke nahi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke pas us ka jo gosht baaqi hai wo khao (aur kuch haraj nahi)"
"683","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat karti hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : paanch janwar moozi hain ke haram ki hudood se bahar aur haram ki hudood ke andar maar diye jayein un mein saanp chitkabra kawwa chooha paagal kutta aur cheel shaamil hain"
"684","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : paanch janwar aisay hain ke un ko haram mein aur ehraam ki haalat mein qatl karnay walay par koi gunah nahi hai wo janwar ye hain : 1 chooha 2 bichhu 3 kawwa 4 cheel 5 paagal kutta"
"685","[AI-translation] ´bin Buhaina raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Makka ki raah mein apne sar ke darmiyani hissa mein pachhnay lagoaye aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ehraam ki haalat mein thay"
"686","[AI-translation] ´Nabeeh bin Wahb kehtay hain ke` ham Abaan bin Usman ke saath niklay aur jab (muqaam) Malal (jo ke Makka ki raah mein Madina se athhaayis meel par hai) mein pahunche to Umar bin Ubaidullah ki aankhein dukhnay lagein aur jab Rauha (muqaam) par pahunche aur dard shadeed ho gaya to unhon ne Abaan bin Usman se (ilaaj ka) poochnay ke liye aadmi bheja unhon ne kaha eelwa ka laip karo us liye ke Usman raziyallahu anhu ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat ki hai ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : ke jab mard ki aankhein dukhnay lagein aur wo ehraam baandhay hue ho to un par eelwa ka laip karay"
"687","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Hunain ne Abdullah bin Abbas aur Miswar bin Makhrama raziyallahu anhu se riwayat ki ke` un donon mein (muqaam) Abwa mein takraar hui (us baat mein ke) Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke mahram sar dho sakta hai aur Miswar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke nahi (dho sakta) Chunanche Abdullah bin Hunain ne kaha ke mujhe Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne Abu Ayyub (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas ye poochnay ke liye bheja to mein ne un ko paya ke wo kunwein ki do lakrion ke baich mein naha rahay thay aur wo aik kapray ki aar mein thay mein ne un ko salam kiya to unhon ne poocha ke kaun hai mein ne kaha ke mein Abdullah bin Hunain hun aur mujhe Abdullah bin Abbas raziyallahu anhuma ne tumhari taraf ye poochnay ke liye bheja hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ehraam mein sar kaisay dhotay thay pas Abu Ayyub (raziyallahu anhu) ne apne donon haath kapray par rakhay aur usay thora sa jhuka diya yahan tak ke mujhe un ka sar nazar aanay laga aur us aadmi se jo un ke sar par pani daal raha tha pani daalnay ka hukm diya to us ne Aap (ke sar) par pani daalnay phir wo apne sar ko hilatay thay aur apne haath se aagay aur peechay miltay thay phir kaha ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko aisay hi (sar dhotay) dekha hai"
"688","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mi'qal kehtay hain ke` mein Ka'b raziyallahu anhu ke paas masjid mein baitha tha mein us aayat ((fafidyat Nabi siyaam au sadqa nusuk)) ke mutaliq poocha to Ka'b raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke ye mere baaray mein naazil thi (phir saara qissa bayan kiya ke) mere sar mein takleef thi to mujhe Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas us haal mein le jaya gaya ke mere sar se mere chehray par jooein gir rahi thin Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mujhe ye gumaan tak na tha ke tujhe itni takleef ho gi acha ! tumharay paas bakri hai mein ne kaha ke nahi to ye aayat naazil hui ((fafidyat Nabi siyaam au sadqa nusuk)) (yani Hajj ke mauqa par ehraam ki haalat mein apne baal us waqt tak na mundwao jab tak qurbani na kar lo albatta kisi ko sar mein takleef ho to wo sar mundwa le lekin us ke saath kaffara ada karay ya to rozay rakhay ya sadqa ya qurbani karay) (Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne) farmaya ke ya to teen rozay rakhnay hun ge ya chhe masaakeen ko khana khulana ho ga ya nisf sa (yani siwa kilo khana) gandum waghera fi kis chhe masaakeen ko deeni ho gi aur (Ka'b raziyallahu anhu ne) farmaya ke ye aayat nuzool ke lihaaz se to mere saath khaas hai lekin amal ke lihaaz se tamam logon ke liye aam hai"
"689","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` aik aadmi oont se gir para aur us ki gardan toot gayi jis se wo faut ho gaya to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke us ko pani aur bairi ke patton se ghusl do aur us ko usi ke do kapron (yani ehraam ki chaadron) mein kafan do aur us ka sar na dhaanpo us liye ke Allah Taala us ko qayamat ke din labbaik pukaarta hua uthaye ga"
"690","[AI-translation] ´Nafi kehtay hain ke` Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) Makka mein jatay hue Zi Tuwa mein raat guzaartay phir subah ghusl kartay aur phir din ke waqt Makka mein daakhil hotay thay aur zikr kartay thay ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne bhi aisa hi kiya hai"
"691","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab (Madina se) nikaltay to Shajara ki raah se nikaltay aur Mu'arras ki raah se daakhil hotay (Mu'arras Madina se chhe meel par aik muqaam hai) aur jab Makka mein daakhil hotay to upar ke teelay se daakhil hotay aur jab nikaltay to neechay ke teelay se nikaltay"
"692","[AI-translation] ´Usama bin Zaid bin Harisa raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ! kiya Aap Makka mein apne ghar rehaish farmayein ge to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : kiya Uqail ne hamaray liye koi ghar ya chaar deewaari chhori hai (ke wahan rehaish karein ge) kyunke Abu Talib ke waris to Uqail aur Talib hue thay aur Ali (raziyallahu anhu) aur Jafar raziyallahu anhu kisi cheez ke waris nahi hue thay kyunke ye donon Musalman ho gaye thay aur Uqail aur Talib Musalman nahi hue thay (us wajah se Musalman aur kafir aik doosray ke waris nahi bin saktay)"
"693","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab Hajj ya Umra mein pehle pehal tawaaf kartay to teen baar daurtay phir chaar baar chaltay phir do rakat namaz padhtay phir Safa aur Marwa ki Sayi kartay"
"694","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne kaha : mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekha ke Hajar-e-Aswad se Hajar-e-Aswad tak teen chakkaron mein daurtay hue tawaaf kiya"
"695","[AI-translation] ´Abu Tufail kehtay hain ke` mein ne Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se kaha ke Aap ka kiya khayal hai tawaaf mein teen baar ramal karna aur chaar baar chalna sunnat hai us liye ke tumharay log kehtay hain ke wo sunnat hai to unhon ne kaha ke wo sache bhi jhootay bhi hain mein ne poocha us ka kiya matlab ke unhon ne sach bola aur jhoot kaha unhon ne kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab Makka mein tashreef laaye to mushrikon ne kaha ke Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke ashaab bait Allah shareef ka tawaaf zuaf aur laaghri o kamzori ke sabab nahi kar saktay aur wo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se hasad rakhtay thay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne hukm diya ke teen baar ramal karein aur chaar baar aadat ke muwafiq chalein (gharz ye hai ke unhon ne us fail ko jo sunnat muakkada maqsooda samjha ye un ka jhoot tha baaqi baat sach thi) phir mein ne kaha ke hamein Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan mein sawaar ho kar Sayi karnay ke baaray mein bataiye ke kiya ye sunnat hai kyunke Aap ke log usay sunnat kehtay hain unhon ne kaha ke wo sache bhi hain aur jhootay bhi mein ne kaha ke us ka kiya matlab unhon ne farmaya ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab Makka mein tashreef laaye to logon ki bheer aisi hui ke kunwari aurtein tak bahar nikal aayein aur log kehnay lagay ke ye Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hain ye Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hain aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam (ki khush khalaqi aisi thi ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke aagay log maaray na jatay thay (yani hato bacho jaisay amraye duniya ke wastay hoti hai waisi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke liye na hoti thi) phir jab logon ki bari bheer hui to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam sawaar ho gaye aur paidal Sayi karna afzal hai (yani itna jhoot hua ke jo cheez bazaroorat hoti thi us ko bila zaroorat sunnat kaha baaqi sach hai ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne sawaar ho kar Sayi ki)"
"696","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Sarjas kehtay hain ke` mein ne asla (yani jis ke sar par baal na hun us se muraad Umar raziyallahu anhu hain) ko dekha (us se maloom hua ke kisi ka laqab agar mashhoor ho jaye aur wo us se bura na manay to us laqab se usay yaad karna durust hai agarchay doosra shakhs bura manay) aur wo Hajar-e-Aswad ko bosa detay hue kehtay thay ke qasam hai Allah Taala ki ke mein tujhe bosa deta hun aur janta hun ke to aik pathar hai ke na nuqsan pahuncha sakta hai aur na nafa de sakta hai aur agar mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko na dekha hota ke wo tujhe bosa detay thay to mein tujhe kabhi bosa na deta (us qaul se but paraston aur gor (qabr) paraston aur chilla paraston ki naani mar gayi jo qabron waghera ko us khayal se bosa detay hain ke hamari muraad dein ge us liye ke jab Hajar-e-Aswad jo Yaman Allah hai us ka bosa bhi ittiba Rasoolullah Kareem sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke sabab se hai na us khayal se ke zarar rasaan ya nafa dihinda hai to phir aur cheezein jin ka bosa kahein saabit nahi balke mana hai us khayal napaak ke saath kyunkar jaaiz ho ga)"
"697","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` jab se mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko Hajar-e-Aswad aur rukn Yamaani ko istilaam kartay hue dekha hai tab se mein ne (bhi un ka istilaam) nahi chhora na sakhti mein na aaraam mein (yani kitni hi bheer bhaar ho mein istilaam nahi chhorta)"
"698","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko ruknain yamaaniyain (Hajar-e-Aswad aur rukn Yamaani) ke ilawa istilaam kartay hue nahi dekha (yani doosray do arkaan ka istilaam nahi kiya)"
"699","[AI-translation] ´Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Hajjat al-Wida mein apni oontni par bait Allah ka tawaaf kiya aur Hajar-e-Aswad ko apni chhari se chhootay thay (sawaar us liye hue) taake log Aap ko dekhein aur Aap oonchay ho jayein aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se masayil poochein us liye ke logon ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko bohat ghaira hua tha"
"700","[AI-translation] ´Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se apne beemar honay ki shikayat ki to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke sab logon ke peechay se sawaar ho kar tawaaf kar lo pas unhon ne kaha ke mein tawaaf karti thi aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam bait Allah ki aik taraf namaz padh rahay thay jis mein Surah at-Toor ki tilawat kar rahay thay"
"701","[AI-translation] ´Urwa kehtay hain ke` mein ne Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se kaha ke agar mein Safa Marwa ki Sayi na karun to mein samajhta hun ke koi haraj nahi unhon ne poocha kyun Urwa ne kaha us liye ke Allah Taala farmata hai ke ” Safa aur Marwa Allah ki nishaniyon mein se hain phir jo koi Hajj ya Umra karay aur un ka tawaaf karay to gunah nahi “ { Baqarah : 158 } Umm ul-Momineen raziyallahu anha ne kaha ke agar ye baat hoti to Allah Taala yun farmata ke agar koi tawaaf na karay to kuch gunah nahi aur ye baat to Ansaar ke logon ke baaray mein naazil ke wo log jab labbaik pukaartay to zamana jahiliyat mein Manaat ke naam se labbaik pukara kartay thay aur kehtay thay ke hamein Safa aur Marwa mein Sayi karna durust nahi phir jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath Hajj ko aaye to unhon ne us baat ka zikr kiya tab Allah Taala ne ye aayat utari pas mujhe apni jaan ki qasam hai us ka Hajj poora na ho ga jo Safa aur Marwa ki Sayi na karay ga aik doosri riwayat mein hai ke Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke kisi ka Hajj aur Umra poora nahi hota jab tak Safa aur Marwa ka tawaaf (yani Sayi) na karay"
"702","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke sahaba ne Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sirf aik dafa Sayi ki hai (yani Makka mein jatay hi tawaaf ke baad phir tawaaf ifaza ke waqt nahi ki)"
"703","[AI-translation] ´Wabara (yani bin Abdur Rahman) kehtay hain ke` mein Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ke paas baitha hua tha ke un ke paas aik aadmi aaya aur us ne kaha ke mujhe Arafaat mein janay se pehle tawaaf karna sahih hai Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke haan to us ne kaha ke Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) to kehtay hain ke Arafaat mein janay se pehle tawaaf na karo Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Hajj kiya aur Arafaat mein janay se pehle bait Allah ka tawaaf kiya to agar to (apne iman mein) sacha hai to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka qaul lena behtar hai ya Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ka } muqaam ibrat hai ke Ibn Abbas jaisay jaleel al-qadr faqeeh sahabi ki baat jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki baat ke khilaf ho to un ki baat ki taraf dekhnay ki bhi ijazat nahi hai che jaaike aaj ki tarah aimma ya peer o murshid ki baaton par bila choon charaan amal ko deen samajh liya jaye { aik doosri riwayat mein hai Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke ham ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Hajj ka ehraam baandha aur bait Allah ka tawaaf kiya aur Safa aur Marwa ki Sayi ki"
"704","[AI-translation] ´Amr bin deenaar kehtay hain ke` ham ne Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se poocha ke aik shakhs Umra ke liye aaya aur bait Allah ka tawaaf karnay ke baad Safa Marwa ki Sayi se pehle apni biwi se sohbat kar sakta hai unhon ne kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Makka mein aaye aur saat chakkaron mein bait Allah ka tawaaf kiya aur muqaam Ibrahim ke peechay do rakat namaz padhi aur Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan saat baar Sayi ki aur tumharay liye Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki hayaat tayyiba uswa hasana hai"
"705","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam fatah Makka ke din aaye aur Kaaba ke sehan mein utray aur (Kaaba ke kaleed bardaar) Usman bin Talha raziyallahu anhu ke paas kehla bheja to wo chaabi laaye aur darwaza khola aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aur Bilal aur Usama aur Usman bin Talha raziyallahu anhuma andar daakhil hue aur darwaza band karnay ka hukm diya to darwaza band kar diya gaya (Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aur sahaba kiraam) thori dair thehray phir darwaza khol diya gaya to mein sab logon se pehle Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se Kaaba ke bahar mila aur Bilal raziyallahu anhu Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke peechay thay pas mein ne Bilal raziyallahu anhu se poocha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne namaz padhi hai unhon ne kaha haan mein ne kaha ke kahan unhon ne kaha ke apne saamnay ke do sutoonon ke darmiyan aur mein bhool gaya ke poochon kitni rakatein padhein"
"706","[AI-translation] ´bin Juraij kehtay hain ke` mein ne Ata se kaha ke kiya to ne Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ko ye kehtay suna hai ke tumhein tawaaf ka hukm hua hai aur Kaaba ke andar janay ka hukm nahi hua Ata ne kaha ke wo us ke andar janay se mana nahi kartay magar mein ne un ko suna kehtay thay ke mujhe Usama bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhu) ne khabar di ke jab Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Kaaba mein daakhil hue to us mein har taraf dua ki aur namaz nahi padhi phir jab niklay to qibla ke aagay do rakat namaz padhi aur farmaya ke yehi qibla hai mein ne un se kaha ke us ke kinaron ka kiya hukm hai aur us ke kaunon mein namaz ka kiya hukm hai to unhon ne kaha ke bait Allah shareef ke har taraf qibla hai"
"707","[AI-translation] ´Jafar bin Muhammad apne walid se riwayat kartay hain ke` ham Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ke ghar gaye to unhon ne sab logon ka (haal) poocha yahan tak ke jab meri baari aayi to mein ne kaha ke mein Muhammad bin Ali hun haseen raziyallahu anhu ka pota to unhon ne meri taraf (shafqat se) haath barhaya aur mere sar par haath rakha aur mere upar ka button khola phir neechay ka button khola (yani shalookay waghera ke) aur phir apni hatheeli mere seenay par donon chhaation ke darmiyan mein rakhi mein un dinon naujawan larka tha phir kaha ke shaabaash khush aamdeed Ae mere bhatijay ! mujh se jo chaho poocho phir mein ne un se poocha aur wo na nabina thay aur itnay mein namaz ka waqt aa gaya to wo aik chaadar orh kar kharay hue ke jab us ke donon kinaron ko donon kandhon par rakhtay thay to wo us chaadar ke chotay honay ke sabab se neechay gir jatay thay aur un ki bari chaadar aik taraf tapaayi par rakhi hui thi phir unhon ne hamein namaz padhayi (yani imamat ki) phir mein ne kaha ke mujhe Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke Hajj ke baaray mein khabar dijiye (yani Hajjat al-Wida se) to Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) ne apne haath se no 9 ka ishara kiya aur kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam no baras tak Madina Munawwara mein rahay aur Hajj nahi kiya phir logon mein daswin saal ailaan kiya ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Hajj ko janay walay hain to Madina mein bohat se log jama ho gaye aur sab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki pairwi chahtay thay aur waisa hi kaam karein (Hajj karnay mein) jaisay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam karein gharz ham log sab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath niklay yahan tak ke Zul Hulaifa pahunche to wahan Asma bint Umais raziyallahu anha ne Muhammad bin Abu Bakr raziyallahu anhu ko jana aur unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se kehla bheja ke (nifaas ki haalat mein) ab kiya karun to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ghusl kar ke aik kapray ka langot baandh kar ehraam baandh lo phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne masjid mein do rakat padhein aur Qaswa oontni par sawaar hue yahan tak ke jab wo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko le kar seedhi hui (muqaam) Baida par to mein ne aagay ki taraf dekha ke jahan tak meri nazar gayi sawaar aur paidal log hi log nazar aatay thay aur apne daayein taraf aur baayein taraf aur peechay bhi logon ki aisi hi bheer thi aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hamaray darmiyan maujood thay aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par Quran shareef utarta tha aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hi us ki haqeeqat ko khoob jantay thay aur jo kaam Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne kiya wohi ham ne bhi kiya phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne tauheed ke saath labbaik pukaari aur logon ne bhi wohi labbaik pukaari jo ab log pukaartay hain (yani Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki labbaik mein kuch lafz barha kar pukaaray aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un ko roka nahi) aur phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam musalsal labbaik hi pukaartay hi rahay aur Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ham Hajj ke siwa aur kuch irada nahi rakhtay aur Umra ko pehchantay hi na thay balke ayyaam Hajj mein Umra baja lana ayyaam jahiliyat se bura jantay thay yahan tak ke jab ham bait Allah mein Aap ke saath aaye to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne rukn (yani Hajar-e-Aswad) ko chhua aur tawaaf mein teen baar ramal kiya (yani uchhal uchhal kar chotay chotay dag rakh kar aur shaane uchhaal uchhaal kar chalay) aur chaar baar aadat ke muwafiq chaltay hue tawaaf poora kiya phir muqaam Ibrahim par aaye aur ye aayat padhi ke ” muqaam Ibrahim ko namaz ki jagah muqarrar karo “ aur muqaam Ibrahim ko apne aur bait Allah ke darmiyan mein kiya phir mere baap kehtay thay aur mein nahi janta ke unhon ne zikr kiya ho (apni taraf se) magar Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se hi zikr kiya ho ga ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne do rakatein padhein aur un mein Surah ” Ikhlaas “ aur Surah ” Kaafiroon “ padhein phir Hajar-e-Aswad ke paas laut kar gaye aur us ko bosa diya aur us darwaza se niklay jo Safa ki taraf hai phir jab Safa ke qareeb pahunche (Safa aik pahari ka naam hai jo Kaaba ke darwazay se bees pachees qadam par hai) to ye aayat padhi ke ” Safa aur Marwa donon Allah ki nishaniyon mein se hain “ aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ham shuru kartay hain jis se Allah ne shuru kiya aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Safa par charhe yahan tak ke bait Allah ko dekha aur qibla ki taraf mutawajjah ho kar Allah Taala ki tauheed aur us ki barayi bayan ki (yani la ilaah illa Allah aur Allah Akbar kaha) aur kaha ke ” koi mabood laiq ibadat nahi siwa Allah Taala ke wo akeela hai us ne apna waada poora kiya (yani deen ke phailanay ka au apne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki madad ka) aur us ne apne banday (Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki madad ki aur us akelay ne sab lashkaron ko shikast di phir us ke baad dua ki phir aisa hi kaha phir dua ki gharz teen baar aisa hi kiya phir utray aur Marwa ki taraf chalay yahan tak ke jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke qadam maidaan ke baich mein utray to dauray yahan tak ke Marwa par pahunche Marwa par bhi waisa hi kiya jaisay ke Safa par kiya tha yani wo kalimaat kahay aur qibla rukh kharay ho kar dua ki yahan tak ke jab Marwa par aakhri chakkar mukammal ho gaya (yani saat chakkar ho chukay) to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke agar mujhe pehle se apna kaam maloom hota jo baad mein maloom hua to mein qurbani saath na lata (aur Makka hi mein khareed leta) aur apne us ehraam Hajj ko Umra kar daalta pas tum mein se jis ke saath qurbani na ho wo ehraam khol daalay (yani tawaaf o Sayi ho chuki aur Umra ke af'aal pooray ho gaye) aur us ko Umra kar le (ye sun kar) Suraaqa bin Ju'shum kharay hue aur arz ki ke Ae Allah ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ! ye Hajj ko Umra kar daalna hamaray usi saal ke liye khaas hai ya hamesha ke liye us ki ijazat hai to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aik haath ki ungliyan doosray haath mein daalein aur do martaba farmaya ke hamesha hamesha ke liye ijazat hai aur Ali (raziyallahu anhu) Yaman se Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke oont le kar aaye to Fatima raziyallahu anha ko dekha ke un mein se hain jinhon ne ehraam khol daalnay tha aur wo rangeen kapray pehnay hui thin aur surma lagao hue thin Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ne bura maana to unhon ne kaha ke mere baap ne us ka hukm farmaya hai rawi ne kaha ke Ali (raziyallahu anhu) Iraq mein kehtay thay ke mein Fatima raziyallahu anha par us ehraam ke kholnay ke sabab se ghussa karta hua Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas gaya aur mein ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko khabar di ke mein ne us ko bura jana to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Fatima raziyallahu anha ne sach kaha (yani mein ne hi un ko ehraam kholnay ka hukm diya hai) phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum ne Hajj ka irada kartay hue kiya niyyat ki thi to mein ne arz kiya ke mein ne kaha ke Ae Allah ! mein usi ka ehraam baandhta hun jis ka tere Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne baandha hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mere saath qurbani hai (us liye mein ne ehraam nahi khola) ab tum bhi ehraam na kholo Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke phir wo oont jo Ali (raziyallahu anhu) Yaman se laaye thay aur wo jo Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apne saath laaye thay sab mil kar sau oont ho gaye Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke phir sab logon ne ehraam khol daalnay aur baal kataraye magar Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aur jin ke saath qurbani thi (mahram hi rahay) phir jab tarwiya ka din hua (yani Zilhajja ki aathwin tareekh) to sab log Mina ko chalay aur Hajj ki labbaik pukaari aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam bhi sawaar hue aur Mina mein Zohar Asr Maghrib aur Isha aur Fajr (paanch namazein) padhein phir thori dair thehray yahan tak ke aaftab nikal aaya aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne wo khema jo baalon ka bana hua tha (muqaam) Namira mein laganay ka hukm diya aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam chalay aur Quraish yaqeen kartay thay ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Mash'ar ul Haraam mein wuqoof karein ge jaisay sab Quraish ke logon ki ayyaam jahiliyat mein aadat thi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam wahan se aagay barh gaye yahan tak ke Arafaat pahunche aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apna khema Namira mein laga hua paya to us mein utray yahan tak ke jab aaftab dhal gaya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke hukm se Qaswa oontni tayyar ki gayi aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam waadi ke darmiyan mein pahunche aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne logon par khutba padha farmaya : tumharay khoon aur amwaal aik doosray par (aisay) haraam hain jaisay aaj ke din ki hurmat us maheena aur us sheher mein hai aur zamana jahiliyat ki har cheez mere donon peeron ke neechay rakh di gayi (yani un cheezon ka aitbaar na raha) aur jahiliyat ke khoon be aitbaar ho gaye aur pehla khoon jo mein apne khoonon mein se maaf karta hun wo bin Rabia ka khoon hai ke wo Bani Sa'd mein doodh peeta tha aur us ko Huzail ne qatl kar daalnay (gharz mein us ka badla nahi leta) aur usi tarah zamana jahiliyat ka sood sab chhor diya gaya (yani us waqt ka charha sood koi na le) aur pehle jo sood ham apne yahan ke sood mein se chhortay hain (aur talab nahi kartay) wo Abbas raziyallahu anhu bin Muttalib ka sood hai us liye ke wo sab chhor diya gaya aur tum log auraton ke baaray mein Allah se daro us liye ke un ko tum ne Allah Taala ki amaan se liya hai aur tum ne un ke satr ko Allah Taala ke kalima (nikah) se halal kiya hai aur tumhara haq un par ye hai ke tumharay bichhonay par kisi aisay shakhs ko na aanay dein (yani tumharay ghar mein) jis ka aana tumhein nagawar ho phir agar wo aisa karein to un ko aisa maaro ke un ko sakht chot na lagay (yani haddi waghera na toote koi uzw zaya na ho Hasan soorat mein farq na aaye ke tumhari khaiti ujar jaye) aur un ka tum par ye haq hai ke un ki roti aur un ka kapra dastoor ke muwafiq tumharay zimma hai aur mein tumharay darmiyan aisi cheez chhoray jata hun ke agar tum usay mazboot pakare raho to kabhi gumrah na ho ge (wo hai) Allah Taala ki kitab aur tum se (qayamat mein) mere baaray mein sawal ho ga to phir tum kiya kaho ge un sab ne arz kiya ke ham gawahi detay hain ke beshak Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Allah Taala ka paigham pahunchaya aur risalat ka haq ada kiya aur ummat ki khairkhwaahi ki phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apni ungusht shahadat (shahadat ki ungli) aasmaan ki taraf uthatay thay aur logon ki taraf jhukatay thay aur farmatay thay ke Ae Allah ! gawah rehna Ae Allah ! gawah rehna Ae Allah ! gawah rehna teen baar (yehi farmaya aur yunhi ishara kiya) phir azaan aur takbeer hui to Zohar ki namaz padhayi aur phir iqamat kahi aur Asr padhayi aur un donon ke darmiyan mein kuch nahi padha (yani sunnat o nafl waghera) phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam sawaar kar mauqif mein aaye oontni ka pait patharon ki taraf kar diya aur pagdandi ko apne aagay kar liya aur qibla ki taraf munh kiya aur gharoob aaftab tak wahein thehray rahay zardi thori thori jati rahi aur sooraj ki tikkiya doob gayi tab (sawaar hue) Usama raziyallahu anhu ko peechay bitha liya aur wapas (Muzdalifa ki taraf) lautay aur Qaswa ki mahaar us qadar kheenchi hui thi ke us ka sar kijaawa ke (aglay hissay) maurak se lag gaya tha (maurak wo jagah hai jahan sawaar baaz waqt thak kar apna peer jo latka hua hota hai us jagah rakhta hai) aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam seedhay haath se ishara kartay thay ke Ae logon ! aahista aahista aaraam se challu aur jab kisi rait ki dhairi par aa jatay (jahan bheer kam patay) to zara mahaar dheeli kar detay yahan tak ke oontni charh jati (aakhir Muzdalifa pahunch gaye aur wahan Maghrib aur Isha aik azaan aur do takbeeron se padhein aur un donon farzon ke baich mein nafl kuch nahi padhay (yani sunnat waghera nahi padhi) phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam lait rahay (SubhanAllah Allah kaisay kaisay khadim hain Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke ke din raat Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke sonay baithnay uthnay jaagnay khanay peenay par nazar hai aur har fail mubarak ki yaaddaasht o hifazat hai Allah Taala un par rehmat karay) yahan tak ke subah hui jab Fajr zaahir ho gayi to azaan aur takbeer ke saath namaz Fajr padhi phir Qaswa oontni par sawaar hue yahan tak ke Mash'ar ul Haraam mein aaye aur wahan qibla ki taraf munh kiya aur Allah Taala se dua ki aur Allah Akbar kaha aur la ilaah illa Allah kaha aur us ki tauheed pukaari aur wahan thehray rahay yahan tak ke bakhoobi roshani ho gayi aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam wahan se tuloo aaftab se qabal lautay aur fazl bin Abbas raziyallahu anhu ko apne peechay bitha liya aur fazl raziyallahu anhu aik naujawan achay baalon wala gora chatta khoobsurat jawan tha phir jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam chalay to auraton ka aik aisa giroh chala jata tha ke aik oont par aik aurat sawaar thi aur sab chali jati thin aur fazl saan ki taraf dekhnay lagay to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne fazl ke chehray par haath rakh diya (aur zubaan se kuch na farmaya SubhanAllah Allah ye akhlaaq ki baat thi aur nai an al-munkar kis khoobi se ada kiya) aur fazl raziyallahu anhu ne apna munh doosri taraf pher liya aur dekhnay lagay (ye un ke kamaal itminaan ki wajah thi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke akhlaaq par) to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne phir apna haath idhar pher kar un ke munh par rakh diya to fazl doosri taraf munh pher kar phir dekhnay lagay yahan tak ke batn Muhassir mein pahunche tab oontni ko zara taiz chalaya aur baich ki raah li jo jamra kubra par ja nikalti hai yahan tak ke us jamra ke paas aaye jo darakht ke paas hai (aur usi ko jamra Uqba kehtay hain) aur saat kankariyan us ko maarein har kankari par Allah Akbar kehtay aisi kankariyan jo chutki se maari jati hain (aur gandum baaqila ke barabar hun) aur waadi ke baich mein kharay ho kar maarein (ke Mina Arafaat aur Muzdalifa daahni taraf aur Makka baayein taraf raha) phir nahr ki jagah aaye aur tirsath oont apne dast mubarak se nahr (yani qurban) kiye baaqi Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ko diye ke unhon ne nahr kiye aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un ko apni qurbani mein shareek kiya aur phir har oont se gosht aik tukra lenay ka hukm farmaya (Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke hukm ke mutaabiq le kar) aik haandi mein daalnay aur pakaya gaya phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aur Ali (raziyallahu anhu) donon ne us mein se gosht khaya aur us ka shorba piya phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam sawaar hue aur bait Allah ki taraf aaye aur tawaaf ifaza kiya aur Zohar Makka mein padhi phir Bani Muttalib ke paas aaye ke wo log Zamzam par pani pila rahay thay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke pani bharo Ae Muttalib ki aulad ! agar mujhe ye khayal na hota ke log bheer kar ke tumhein pani na bharnay dein ge to mein bhi tumhara shareek ho kar pani bharta (yani jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam bhartay to sunnat ho jata to phir saari ummat bharnay lagti aur un ki siqaayat jati rehti) phir un logon ne aik dole Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko diya aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us mein se piya"
"708","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` jab ham subah ko Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath Mina se Arafaat ki taraf chalay to ham mein se koi labbaik pukaarta tha aur koi takbeer kehta tha"
"709","[AI-translation] ´Muhammad bin Abu Bakr Saqafi raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se poocha aur wo donon Mina se Arafaat ko ja rahay thay ke tum log aaj ke din Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath kiya kartay thay Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke koi ham mein se la ilaah illa Allah kehta tha to us ko koi mana na karta tha aur koi ham mein se Allah Akbar kehta tha to us ko bhi koi mana na karta tha"
"710","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne kaha ke Quraish aur wo log jo Quraish ke deen par thay Muzdalifa mein wuqoof kartay thay aur apne ko Hums kehtay thay (Abu Haisam ne kaha hai ke ye naam Quraish ka hai aur un ki aulad ka aur Kinana aur Jadeela Qais ka us liye ke wo apne deen mein Hums rakhtay thay yani tashaddud aur sakhti kartay thay) aur baaqi Arab ke log Arafa mein wuqoof kartay thay phir jab Islam aaya to Allah Taala ne apne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko hukm farmaya ke Arafaat mein aayein aur wahan wuqoof farmayein aur wahein se lautein aur yehi matlab hai us aayat ka ke ” wahein se lauto jahan se sab log laut-tay hain “"
"711","[AI-translation] ´Jubair bin Mut'im raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` mera aik oont kho gaya mein Arafa ke din us ki talaash mein nikla to kiya dekhta hun ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam logon ke saath Arafaat mein kharay hain to mein ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam ye to Hums ke log hain ye yahan tak kaisay aa gaye (yani Quraish to Muzdalifa se aagay nahi aatay thay) aur Quraish Hums mein shumaar kiye jatay thay (jo log Muzdalifa se bahar na jatay thay)"
"712","[AI-translation] ´Kuraib se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne Usama bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhu) se poocha ke jab tum Arafa ki shaam Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke peechay sawaar thay to tum ne kiya kiya tha unhon ne kaha ke ham us ghaati tak aaye jahan log namaz Maghrib ke liye oonton ko bithatay hain pas Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne oontni ko bithaya utray aur peshaab kiya aur pani baanay ka zikr Usama raziyallahu anhu ne nahi kiya phir wuzu ka pani maanga aur halka sa wuzu kiya poora nahi (yani aik aik baar aaza dhoye) aur mein ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! namaz Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke namaz tumharay aagay hai phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam sawaar hue yahan tak ke ham Muzdalifa aaye aur Maghrib ki namaz ki takbeer hui aur logon ne oont bithaye aur khole nahi yahan tak ke Isha ki takbeer hui aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne namaz Isha padhayi phir oont khol diye mein ne kaha ke phir tum ne subah ko kiya kiya unhon ne kaha ke phir fazl bin Abbas raziyallahu anhu Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath peechay sawaar hue aur mein Quraish ke pehle chalnay walon ke saath paidal chala"
"713","[AI-translation] ´Urwa se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne kaha ke mere saamnay kisi ne Usama bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhu) se poocha (ya unhon ne kaha ke mein ne khud Usama raziyallahu anhu se poocha) aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un ko Arafaat se apni oontni par sawaar kar liya tha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kaisay chaltay thay (yani oontni ko kis chaal se liye jatay thay) to unhon ne kaha ke meethi (aahistagi se) chaal chalatay thay phir jab zara khuli jagah patay yani jahan bheer kam hoti to us jagah zara taiz kar detay"
"714","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Maghrib aur Isha ki namaz Muzdalifa mein jama kar ke padhi aur un donon (namazon) ke darmiyan aik rakat bhi nahi padhi aur Maghrib ki teen rakat aur Isha ki do rakatein padhein aur Abdullah raziyallahu anhu bhi usi tarah (Maghrib aur Isha) jama kar ke padhtay rahay yahan tak ke Allah Taala se mil gaye"
"715","[AI-translation] ´Sa'eed bin Jubair raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` ham Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ke saath laut kar Muzdalifa mein aaye to wahan unhon ne hamein Maghrib aur Isha aik takbeer se padhayi phir lautay aur kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne hamein usi muqaam par usi tarah namaz padhayi thi"
"716","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko hamesha namaz waqt par hi padhtay dekha magar do namazein aik Maghrib o Isha ke Muzdalifa mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mila kar padhein aur (doosri) us ki subah ko namaz Fajr apne (ma'roof) waqt se pehle padhi"
"717","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne kaha : Umm ul-Momineen Sauda raziyallahu anha ne Muzdalifa ki raat Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se ijazat maangi ke Aap se pehle Mina ko laut jayein aur logon ki bheer bhaar se aagay nikal jayein aur wo zara farba (yani bhaari) aurat thin rawi ne kaha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un ko ijazat de di aur wo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke lautnay se qabal rawana ho gayein aur ham log ruke rahay yahan tak ke ham ne subah ki aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath lautay (Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain) agar mein bhi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se ijazat le leti jaisay Sauda raziyallahu anha ne li thi aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki ijazat se chali jati to khoob tha aur us se behtar tha jis ke sabab se mein khush ho rahi thi"
"718","[AI-translation] ´Asma (raziyallahu anha) ke azaad kardah ghulam Abdullah kehtay hain ke` mujh se Asma (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha aur wo Muzdalifa daar ke paas thehari hui thin ke kiya chaand gharoob ho gaya mein ne kaha ke nahi to unhon ne thori dair namaz padhi phir mujh se kaha ke Ae mere bachay ! kiya chaand doob gaya mein ne kaha haan unhon ne kaha ke mere saath rawana ho pas ham rawana hue yahan tak ke unhon ne jamra ko kankariyan maar lein phir apni jaye qayaam par namaz padhi mein ne kaha ke ham bohat subah sauiray rawana hue to unhon ne kaha ke Ae mere betay ! kuch haraj nahi kyunke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne auraton ko subah sauiray rawana honay ki ijazat di hai"
"719","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` mujhe Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Muzdalifa se samaan ke saath (ya yun kaha ke zaeefon ke hamraah) raat ko hi bhej diya"
"720","[AI-translation] ´Salim bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke` (un ke walid) Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) apne saath ke zaeef logon ko aagay bhej detay thay ke wo al-Mash'ar ul Haraam mein jo ke Muzdalifa mein hai raat ko wuqoof kar lein aur Allah Taala ko yaad kartay rahein jab tak chahein phir Imam ke wuqoof karnay se pehle laut jayein sau un mein se koi to subah ki namaz ke waqt Mina pahunch jata tha aur koi us ke baad pahunchta aur Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay thay ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un zaeefon ko us ki ijazat di hai"
"721","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne fazl (bin Abbas) raziyallahu anhu ko Muzdalifa se apne peechay oontni par bitha liya tha (rawi ne) kaha ke mujhe Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne khabar di aur unhein fazl raziyallahu anhu ne ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jamra Uqba ki rami tak labbaik pukaartay rahay"
"722","[AI-translation] ´Abdur Rahman bin Yazid se riwayat hai ke` Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) jab Muzdalifa se lautay to labbaik pukaari to logon ne kaha ke shayad ye gaon ka koi aadmi hai (yani jo ab labbaik pukaarta hai) to Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha kiya log bhool gaye (yani sunnat Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ya gumrah ho gaye mein ne khud un se suna hai jin par Surah Baqarah naazil hui (yani Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se) ke wo us jagah mein labbaik pukaartay thay"
"723","[AI-translation] ´A'mash se riwayat hai kehtay hain ke` mein ne Hajjaj bin Yusuf se khutba mein kehtay hue suna : Quran shareef ki wohi tarteeb rakho ke jo Jibrail alaihissalam ne rakhi hai wo surat pehle ho jis mein baqara ka zikr hai phir wo surat jis mein Nisa ka zikr hai phir wo surat jis mein aal Imran ka zikr hai A'mash ne kaha ke phir mein Ibrahim se mila to un ko us baat ki khabar di to unhon ne us ko bura bhala kaha aur phir kaha ke mujh se Abdur Rahman bin Yazid ne riwayat ki ke wo Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) ke saath thay aur wo jamra Uqba par aaye aur batn ul Waadi mein jamra ko saamnay rakhtay hue kharay hue aur us ko saat kankariyan naala ke peechay se maarein aur har kankari par Allah Akbar kehtay thay (rawi ne) kaha ke mein ne un se kaha ke Ae Abu Abdur Rahman ! (ye kunniyat hai Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) ki) log to upar se kharay ho kar kankariyan maartay hain to unhon ne kaha ke us mabood ki qasam jis ke siwa koi mabood nahi hai ye jagah us ki hai jis par Surah Baqarah naazil hai (yani Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne yeein se kankariyan maari thin)"
"724","[AI-translation] ´Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekha ke wo jamra Uqba ko qurbani ke din apni oontni par se kankar maartay thay aur farmatay thay ke mujh se apne Hajj ke manaasik seekh lo us liye ke mein nahi janta ke us ke baad Hajj karun"
"725","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekha hai ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne jamra ko wo kankariyan maarein jo chutki se phainki jati hain"
"726","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne nahr ke din chasht ke waqt jamra ko kankariyan maarein aur baad ke dinon mein jab aaftab dhal gaya"
"727","[AI-translation] ´Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke istinja ke liye dheelay lena taaq hain aur jamra ki kankariyan taaq hain aur Safa aur Marwa ki Sayi taaq hai aur Kaaba ka tawaaf taaq hai (yani aakhri teenon saat saat hain) aur zaroor hai ke jo istinjay ke liye pathar le to taaq le (yani teen ya paanch jis mein taharat khoob ho jaye yani agar taharat chaar mein ho jaye to bhi aik aur le taake taaq ho jayein aur baaz bewaqoof fuqaha ne jo ye likha hai ke dheelay ke tayein taharat ke waqt teen baar thonk le ke tasbeeh se baaz rahay ye bidat be asal aur laghw harkat hai aur taaq dheelay lena jamhoor ulama ke qareeb mustahab hai)"
"728","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Hajjat al-Wida mein apna sar mundwaya"
"729","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ” Ae Allah ! sar mundwanay walon ko bakhsh de “ logon ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ! baal katarwanay walon ko bhi phir farmaya ke ” Ae Allah ! sar mundwanay walon ko bakhsh de “ logon ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ! katarwanay walon ko bhi (yani un ki maghfirat ki bhi dua kijiye) Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ” Ae Allah ! sar mundwanay walon ko bakhsh de “ phir logon ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ! katarwanay walon ki (maghfirat ki bhi dua kijiye) phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke katarwanay walon ki (bhi maghfirat farma)"
"730","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne jamra Uqba ki rami ki phir qurbani ke oonton ke paas aaye nahr kiya aur hajjaam baitha hua tha Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apne haath se sar ki taraf ishara farmaya pas hajjaam ne daahni taraf moond di to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne wo baal un logon mein taqseem kar diye jo Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke qareeb thay phir farmaya ke ab doosri jaanib moondo ! pas poocha ke Talha sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kahan hain phir wo baal un ko inayat farmaye"
"731","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apni oontni par sawaar ho kar kharay thay aur log Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se masayil poochnay lagay pas aik ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ! mein ne na jana ke rami nahr se pehle zaroori hai aur mein ne rami se pehle nahr kar liya hai to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : koi haraj nahi ab rami kar lo aur doosray ne kaha ke mein ne na jana ke qurbani sar mundwanay se pehle karni chahiye aur mein ne qurbani se pehle sar mundwa liya hai to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ab nahr kar lo aur kuch haraj nahi (rawi) ne kaha ke mein ne suna ke us din jis ne bhi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se koi aisa kaam ke jisay insaan bhool jata hai aur aagay peechay kar leta hai us ke mutaliq poocha to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne yehi farmaya ke ab kar lo aur kuch haraj nahi"
"732","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jamra Uqba ke paas kharay hue thay ke shakhs Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ! mein ne kankariyan maarnay se pehle sar mundwa liya hai to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ab kankariyan maar lo aur kuch haraj nahi aur doosra shakhs aaya aur arz kiya ke mein ne rami se pehle zabah kar liya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ab rami kar lo aur kuch haraj nahi aur teesra shakhs aaya aur arz kiya ke mein ne rami se pehle bait Allah ka tawaaf ifaza kar liya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ab rami kar lo aur kuch haraj nahi rawi ne kaha ke us din Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se jo cheez poochi gayi ke aagay peechay ho gayi hai to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ab kar lo aur kuch haraj nahi hai"
"733","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Zohar ki namaz Zul Hulaifa mein padhi phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apni oontni mangwayi aur Aap ne us ki kohaan ke daayein pehlu mein ashaar kiya (barchhi waghera se zakhm kar ke khoon nikalna taake qurbani ke janwar ki nishani ho jaye) phir us khoon ko haath se mil diya aur oontni ke galay mein do jotion ko latka diya phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apni sawaari par sawaar hue jab wo maidaan mein seedhi khari ho gayi to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Hajj ka talbiya padha (talbiya ” labbaik Allahumma labbaik “ ko kehtay hain)"
"734","[AI-translation] ´Umra bint Abdur Rahman se riwayat hai ke` bin Ziyad ne Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ko likha ke Abdullah bin Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke jis ne (baghair Hajj o Umra ke ghar mein rehtay hue) qurbani bheji us par wo cheezein jo haaji par haraam hoti hain jab tak ke qurbani zabah na ho jaye haraam ho gayein aur mein ne qurbani rawana ki hai pas jo hukm ho mujhe bata dijiye Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke bin Abbas raziyallahu anhuma ne jis tarah kaha waisa nahi hai mein ne khud Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki qurbaniyon ke haar battay hain aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un ke galay mein daal kar mere walid ke saath qurbani rawana kar di aur us ke zabah tak koi cheez Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par haraam na hui jo Allah Taala ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par halal ki thi"
"735","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aik dafa bait Allah ko bakriyan bhejein aur un ke galay mein haar daalnay"
"736","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aik shakhs ko dekha ke qurbani ka oont kheenchtay hue dekha to farmaya ke us par sawaar ho ja us ne arz kiya ke ye qurbani ka hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke us par sawaar ho ja aur doosri ya teesri baar farmaya ke tere liye kharaabi ho"
"737","[AI-translation] ´Abu Zubair kehtay hain ke` mein ne Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) se suna aur un se qurbani ke janwar par sawaari karnay ke baaray mein poocha gaya tha to unhon ne kaha ke jab tumhein zaroorat ho (aur sawaari na milay) us par us tarah sawaar ho ke takleef na do"
"738","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` un se Zu'aib Abu Qabeesa raziyallahu anhu ne bayan kiya ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mere saath qurbani ke oont rawana kartay thay aur hukm detay thay ke agar koi un mein se thak jaye aur marnay ka darr ho to us ko nahr kar dena aur us ki jootiyan khoon mein dubo kar us ke kohaan mein (chhaapa) maar dena aur na tum khana aur na tumhara koi rafeeq us mein se khaye"
"739","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` ham Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath Hajj ka ehraam baandh kar niklay to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne hamein hukm diya ke ham mein se saat saat aadmi oont aur gaaye mein shareek ho jayein"
"740","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne qurbani ke din Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ki taraf se aik gaaye zabah ki"
"741","[AI-translation] ´Ziyad bin Jubair se riwayat hai ke` Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ne aik shakhs ko dekha ke wo oont ko bitha kar nahr kar raha hai to kaha ke us ko utha kar khara kar ke peer baandh kar nahr karo yehi tumharay Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki sunnat hai"
"742","[AI-translation] ´Ali (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mujhe Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne hukm farmaya ke mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke qurbani ke oonton par khara rahun aur un ka gosht khaalein aur jhoolein khairaat kar dun aur qassaab ki mazdoori us mein se na dun aur Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke qassaab ki mazdoori ham apne paas se dein ge"
"743","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne qurbani ke din tawaaf ifaza kiya aur phir wapas aa kar Zohar ki namaz Mina mein padhi Nafi ne kaha ke Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) qurbani ke din tawaaf ifaza kar ke laut-tay thay aur namaz Zohar Mina mein padhtay thay aur kehtay thay ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam bhi aisa hi kartay thay"
"744","[AI-translation] ´bin Juraij se riwayat hai ke unhein Ata ne khabar di ke` Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) fatwa detay thay ke jis ne bait Allah ka tawaaf kiya wo halal ho gaya khwah haaji ho ya ghair haaji (yani Umra karnay wala ho) mein ne Ata se kaha ke wo ye baat kahan se letay thay unhon ne kaha ke us aayat se ke Allah Taala ne farmaya ke ” phir jagah us qurbani ke pahunchnay ki bait Allah tak hai “ { Hajj : 33 } to mein ne kaha ke ye to Arafaat se aanay ke baad hai to unhon ne kaha ke Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ka qaul ye hai (ke mehal us ka) bait Allah hai khwah baad Arafaat ke ho ya us se pehle aur wo ye baat Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke fail mubarak se nikaaltay thay Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam khud Hajjat al-Wida mein logon ko ehraam kholnay ka hukm detay thay"
"745","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke` wo (muqaam) Sarif mein haiza ho gayein aur Arafa mein paak huein (yani wuqoof ke liye ghusl kiya) aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tumhein Safa aur Marwa ka tawaaf Hajj aur Umra donon ke liye kaafi hai"
"746","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) bayan karti hain ke` ham Hajjat al-Wida ke saal Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath (Madina se) niklay ham mein se kuch logon ne sirf Umare ka ehraam baandha kuch ne Hajj aur Umra donon ka ehraam baandha aur kuch ne sirf Hajj ka ehraam baandha tha aur khud Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne sirf Hajj ka ehraam baandha tha (Chunanche) jis ne sirf Umra ka ehraam baandha tha wo to (tawaaf kartay hi) halal ho gaya lekin jis ne Hajj ka ya Hajj aur Umra (donon) ka ehraam baandha tha wo yaum un Nehr (qurbani ke din) tak halal nahi hue"
"747","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aur Abu Bakr aur Umar raziyallahu anhuma Abtah mein utra kartay thay"
"748","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Abtah (Muhassab) mein utarna koi sunnat (muakkada) nahi aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam to sirf us liye wahan utray thay ke wahan se nikalna aasaan tha jab Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam (Mina se Makka ki taraf) niklay"
"749","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` ham Mina mein thay Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ham se farmaya : kal ham Khaif Bani Kinana mein utarnay walay hain jahan kafiron ne kufr par qasam khayi thi aur ye ke Quraish aur Bani Kinana ne qasam khayi ke Bani Hashim aur Bani Muttalib se (yani un ke qabeelon se) us waqt tak nikah na karein ge na khareed o farokht karein jab tak ye Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko un ke supurd na kar dein aur muraad Khaif Bani Kinana se Muhassab hai"
"750","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` Abbas bin Muttalib raziyallahu anhu ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se ijazat maangi ke Mina ki raaton mein Makka mein rahein us liye ke un ko Zamzam pilanay ki khidmat thi to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne unhein ijazat de di"
"751","[AI-translation] ´Bakr bin Abdullah Muzani kehtay hain ke` mein Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ke paas Kaaba ke qareeb baitha hua tha ke aik gaon ka aadmi aaya aur us ne kaha ke kiya sabab hai ke mein tumharay chacha ki aulad ko dekhta hun ke wo shehed ka bartan aur doodh pilatay hain aur tum khajoor ka bartan pilatay ho tum ne mohtaaji ke sabab se usay ikhtiyar kiya hai ya bakheeli ki wajah se to Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke Alhamdulillah ! na hamein mohtaaji hai na bakheeli us ki asal wajah ye hai ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apni oontni par tashreef laaye aur un ke peechay Usama raziyallahu anhu thay aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne pani maanga to ham aik pyala mein khajoor ka bartan laaye aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne piya aur us mein se jo bacha wo Usama raziyallahu anhu ko pilaya aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum ne khoob acha kaam kiya aur aisa hi kiya karo pas jis ka hukm Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam de chukay hain ham us ko badalna nahi chahtay"
"752","[AI-translation] ´Abdur Rahman bin Humaid kehtay hain ke` mein ne Umar bin Abdul Aziz se suna wo apni majlis mein baithay hue logon se keh rahay thay ke tum ne Makka mein rehaish ke baaray mein kiya suna hai to Saib bin Yazid ne kaha ke mein ne Ala' raziyallahu anhu (ya kaha ke Ala' bin Hazrami raziyallahu anhu) se suna hai wo kehtay thay ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Muhaajir Hajj ke manaasik ada karnay ke baad teen roz tak Makka mein thehray (muraad ye thi ke us se zyada na rahay) (Makka se hijrat karnay walon ke liye hijrat karnay ke baad Makka mein iqamat karna ya Makka ko watan banana mamnoo kar diya gaya tha albatta Hajj aur Umra ke baad teen din ki ijazat us hadees mein hai)"
"753","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` log idhar idhar chal phir rahay thay ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke koi shakhs kooch na karay jab tak ke chaltay waqt bait Allah ka tawaaf na kar le"
"754","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Umm ul-Momineen Safiyya bint Huyay raziyallahu anha tawaaf ifaza ke baad haiz se ho gayein to mein ne us ka tazkira Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se kiya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kiya wo (Umm ul-Momineen Safiyya raziyallahu anha) hamein Makka mein rok de gi Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya ke Ae Allah ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ! unhon ne tawaaf ifaza kar liya tha phir baad mein haiz se huein hain to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke phir wo (hamaray saath) wapas chalay"
"755","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` logon ko hukm kiya gaya hai ke aakhir mein bait Allah ke paas se ho kar (yani tawaaf kar ke) jayein aur haiza par takhfeef ho gayi (yani tawaaf wada' ke liye)"
"756","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` log jahiliyat mein (yani Islam se pehle) Hajj ke dinon mein Umra karnay ko zameen par sab se bara gunah jantay thay aur mahram ke maheena ko Safar kar diya kartay thay } us liye ke teen maheena musalsal maheenay haraam aatay hain jo Ziqa'da Zi Hijja aur mahram hain to wo ghabra jatay aur laut maar na kar saktay kyunke mushrikeen Makka bhi hurmat walay maheenon ka ehtiraam kartay thay (afsos ki baat ye hai ke aaj Musalmanon ko ye bhi ilm nahi ke hurmat walay maheena kaun kaun se hain un ka ehtiraam to door ki baat hai) us liye ye shararat nikaali ke mahram ki jagah Safar ko likh diya aur khoob laut maar ki aur jab Safar ka maheena aaya to mahram ki tarah us ka adab kiya aur yehi nasi thi jis ko Quran mein Allah Taala mushrikon ki aadat farmata hai { kehtay thay ke jab oonton ki peethein achi ho jayein (yani jo Hajj ke safar ke sabab se lag gayi hain aur zakhmi ho gayi hain) aur raston se haajion ke oonton ke nishan qadam mit jayein aur Safar ka maheena tamam ho jaye tab Umra karnay walay ko Umra jaaiz hai phir jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke sahaba chauthi Zi Hijja ko ehraam baandhay hue Makka mein daakhil hue to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne un ko hukm farmaya ke us Hajj ke ehraam ko Umra bana lein (jaisay bin qeem waghera ka mazhab hai) pas logon ko ye bari anokhi baat lagi aur unhon ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ! ham kaisay halal hun (yani pooray ya adhooray ke baaz cheez se bachtay rahein) to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke pooray halal ho (yani kisi cheez se parhaiz ki zaroorat nahi)"
"757","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Ansaar mein se aik aurat se jis ko Umm Sinaan kaha jata tha farmaya ke tum hamaray saath Hajj ko kyun nahi chalti to us ne kaha ke hamaray shohar ke paas do hi oont thay aik par wo aur un ka larka Hajj ko gaya hai aur doosray par hamara ghulam pani lata hai to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ramazan mein Umra Hajj ke barabar hai (ya farmaya ke hamaray saath Hajj karnay ke barabar hai)"
"758","[AI-translation] ´Ishaq kehtay hain ke` mein ne Zaid bin Arqam raziyallahu anhu se poocha ke tum Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath kitnay ghazawaat mein shareek rahay unhon ne kaha ke satra ghazawaat mein aur unhon ne mujh se bayan kiya ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Unees ghazawaat kiye aur hijrat ke baad aik Hajj kiya jisay Hajjat al-Wida kehtay hain (rawi hadees) Ishaq ne kaha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne doosra Hajj Makka mein (hijrat se pehle) kiya tha"
"759","[AI-translation] ´Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne chaar Umare kiye aur jo Hajj ke saath kiya tha us ke ilawa sab Zilqada mein kiye aik Umra Hudaibiya se ya Hudaibiya ke saal Zilqada mein doosra us ke baad ke saal mein Zilqada mein teesra Umra jo Jirana se jahan ghazwa Hunain ka maal ghaneemat taqseem kiya tha wo bhi Zilqada mein kiya aur chautha Umra wo jo Hajj ke saath hua"
"760","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` unhein Muawiya bin Sufyan raziyallahu anhu ne khabar di unhon ne kaha ke mein ne Marwa (pahari) par Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke baal teer ki bhaal se katare (ya ye kaha ke mein ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko Marwa par dekha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam teer ki bhaal se baal katarwa rahay hain)"
"761","[AI-translation] ´Umm ul-Momineen (Aisha Siddiqa) raziyallahu anha kehti hain ke` mein ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! log Makka se do ibadaton (yani Hajj aur Umra judagaana) ke saath lautein ge aur mein aik ibadat ke saath lauton gi to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum thehro jab tum paak ho gi to Taneem ko jana aur labbaik pukaarna aur phir ham se falan falan muqaam mein milna mein gumaan karta hun ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kal ke roz aur tumharay us Umra ka sawab tumhari takleef aur kharch ke muwafiq hai"
"762","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab lashkaron se ya lashkaron ki choti jamaat se ya Hajj o Umra se laut-tay to jab kisi teela par ya oonchi kankareeli zameen par pahunch jatay to teen baar Allah Akbar kehtay phir kehtay ke koi ibadat ke laiq nahi hai siwae Allah Taala ke aur us ka koi shareek nahi hai usi ki saltanat hai aur usi ke liye sab tareef hai aur wo har cheez par qudrat rakhta hai aur ham lautnay walay rujoo honay walay ibadat karnay walay sajda karnay walay aur apne Rab ki khaas hamd karnay walay hain Allah Taala ne apna waada sacha kiya aur apne banday ki madad ki aur (kafiron ke) lashkaron ko usi akelay ne shikast di"
"763","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Zul Hulaifa ki kankareeli zameen mein apna oont bithaya tha aur wahan namaz padhi thi aur (khud) Abdullah bin Umar raziyallahu anhuma usi tarah kiya kartay thay"
"764","[AI-translation] ´Nafi se riwayat hai ke` Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) jab Hajj ya Umra se wapas aatay to Zul Hulaifa ki kankareeli zameen par apna oont bitha detay jahan Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apna oont bithatay thay"
"765","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aakhir shab Zul Hulaifa mein batn ul Waadi mein aaraam farmatay thay ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paalish (farishta) aaya aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se kaha gaya ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Batha aadat-e-mubarak mein hain Musa rawi ka kehna hai ke Salim ne hamari sawaari ko wahan bithaya jahan masjid ke paas Abdullah bin Umar raziyallahu anhuma bithaya kartay thay aur wo Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki raat guzaarnay wali jagah ko talaash kartay thay aur wo jagah us masjid se neechay hai jo waadi ke nasheeb mein Bani hui hai aur jagah masjid aur qibla ke darmiyan mein hai"
"766","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` jab Allah Taala ne apne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko Makka par fatah di to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne logon mein kharay ho kar Allah Taala ki hamd o sana ki phir farmaya ke Allah Taala ne ashaab Feel ko Makka se rok diya aur apne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko aur mominon ko us par musallat farma diya aur mujh se pehle us mein larna kisi ko halal nahi hua aur mere liye din ki aik ghari ke liye halal kiya gaya aur ab mere baad kabhi bhi kisi ke liye halal na ho ga phir us ka shikaar na bhagaya jaye us ka kaanta na tora jaye us ki giri pari cheez na uthayi jaye magar wo shakhs uthaye jo batata phiray ke jis ki ho usay de aur jis ka koi shakhs qatl kar diya gaya to us ko do baaton ka ikhtiyar hai khwah fidya le le yani (khoon baha le) aur khwah qaatil ko qisaas mein marwa daalay Abbas raziyallahu anhu ne arz ki ke Ae Allah ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ! siwae izkhir ke (ke us ko haraam na kijiye) ke ham us ko apni qabron mein daaltay hain aur gharon mein istemaal kartay hain (chhat mein istemaal hota hai) to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke khair izkhir (yani ghaas ki ijazat hai) tor lo phir Yaman ka Abu Shah naami aik shakhs utha aur us ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mujhe likh dijiye Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Abu Shah ko likh do Waleed ne kaha ke mein ne Auzaa'i se poocha ke us ka kiya matlab hai ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mujhe likh dijiye unhon ne kaha ke yehi khutba jo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya (yani us ko Abu Shah ne likhwa liya ke baray nafa ki baat thi)"
"767","[AI-translation] ´Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke kisi ko halal nahi ke Makka mein hathiyar uthaye"
"768","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Abdullah Ansari raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Makka mein daakhil hue (Qutaiba ne kaha ke fatah Makka ke din daakhil hue) aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par siyah amama tha (aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) baghair ehraam ke (daakhil hue thay)"
"769","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` jis saal Makka fatah hua Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam sar par khud pehnay hue Makka mein daakhil hue phir jab khud utara to aik shakhs ne aa kar kaha ke bin Khatal Kaaba ke pardon ko pakare (chhupa hua) hai to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke us ko maar daalo"
"770","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se poocha ke kiya Hateem ki deewar bait Allah mein daakhil hai to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke haan (us se Imam Abu Haneefa ka mazhab radd hua aur Hateem ke andar tawaaf naajaayiz hua us liye ke wo bait Allah mein daakhil hai) mein ne (phir) arz kiya ke us ko unhon ne bait Allah mein kyun na daakhil kiya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : tumhari qaum ke paas kharch kam ho gaya tha (phir) mein ne arz kiya ke us ka darwaza kyun itna ooncha hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ye bhi tumhari qaum ka kiya hua hai taake jis ko chahein usay us mein janay dein aur jis ko chahein na janay dein aur agar tumhari qaum ne nayi nayi jahiliyat na chhori hoti aur mujhe ye khayal na hota ke wo us ko nagawar samajhein ge to mein irada karta ke Hateem ki deewaron ko bait Allah mein daakhil kar deta aur us ka darwaza zameen ke saath laga deta"
"771","[AI-translation] ´Ata kehtay hain ke` jab Yazid bin Muawiya ke door mein ahl shaam ki larai mein jab Kaaba Jal gaya aur us ka jo haal hua sau hua to bin Zubair raziyallahu anhu ne Kaaba shareef ko waisa hi rehnay diya yahan tak ke log mausam Hajj mein jama hue aur bin Zubair raziyallahu anhu ka irada tha ke logon ko khana Kaaba dikha kar unhein ahl shaam ki larai par jur'at dilaayein ya unhein ahl shaam ke khilaf larai ke liye tayyar karein phir jab log janay lagay to unhon ne kaha ke Ae logon ! mujhe khana Kaaba ke baaray mein mashwara do ke mein usay tor kar naye sare se banaon ya us mein se jo hissa kharaab ho gaya hai usay durust karun Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke mujhe aik raye soojhi aur wo ye hai ke tum un mein se jo kharaab ho gaya hai sirf us ki marammat kar do aur khana Kaaba ko waisa hi rehnay do jaisa ke ibtida Islam mein tha aur unhi patharon ko rehnay do jin par log Musalman hue thay aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam mab'oos hue thay bin Zubair raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke agar tum mein se kisi ka ghar Jal jaye to us ka dil kabhi raazi na ho ga jab tak naya na binaye phir tumharay Rab ka ghar to us se kahein afzal hai us ka kiya haal hai aur mein apne Rab se teen baar istikhaara karta hun phir apne kaam ka musammam irada karta hun phir jab teen baar istikhaara kar chukay to un ki raye mein aaya ke khana Kaaba ko tor kar banayein aur log khauf karnay lagay ke aisa na ho ke jo shakhs pehle khana Kaaba ke upar tornay ko charhe us par koi bulaye aasmaani naazil ho jaye (us se maloom hua ke Maalik us ghar ka upar hai aur tamam sahaba ka yehi aqeeda tha) yahan tak ke aik shakhs charha aur us mein se aik pathar gira diya phir jab logon ne dekha ke us par koi bila nahi naazil to aik doosray par girnay lagay aur khana mubarak ko dhaa kar zameen tak pahuncha diya aur bin Zubair ne chand sutoon kharay kar ke un par parda daal diya (taake log usi parda ki taraf namaz padhtay rahein aur muqaam Kaaba ko jantay rahein aur wo parday paray rahay) yahan tak ke us ki deewarein oonchi ho gayein aur bin Zubair raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke mein ne Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se suna hai ke wo kehti thin ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke agar log naye naye kufr na chhoray hotay aur mere paas bhi itna kharch nahi hai ke us ko bana sakun warna mein Hateem se paanch haath Kaaba mein daakhil kar deta aur aik darwaza us mein aisa bana deta ke log us mein daakhil hotay aur doosra aisa banata ke log us se bahar jatay phir bin Zubair raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke ham aaj ke din itna kharch bhi rakhtay hain ke usay sirf karein aur logon ka khauf bhi nahi rawi ne kaha ke phir bin Zubair raziyallahu anhu ne us ki deewarein Hateem ki jaanib se paanch haath zyada kar dein yahan tak ke wahan par aik neev (bunyaad) nikli ke logon ne usay achi tarah dekha (aur wo bunyaad Ibrahim alaihissalam ki thi) phir usi bunyaad par se deewar uthana shuru ki aur Kaaba ki lambayi athhara zira thi phir jab us mein zyada kiya to chota nazar aanay laga (yani chauraan zyada ho gayi aur lambaan kam nazar aanay lagi) pas us ki lambaan mein bhi das zira zyada kar diye aur us ke do darwazay rakhay aik mein se andar jayein aur doosray se bahar aayein phir jab Abdullah bin Zubair raziyallahu anhu shaheed ho gaye to Hajjaj ne Abdul Malik bin Marwan ko ye khabar likh bheji ke bin Zubair raziyallahu anhu ne jo bunyaad rakhi hai wo unhi bunyaadon par rakhi hai jis ko Makka ke mo'tabar log dekh chukay hain (yani Ibrahim alaihissalam ki bunyaad par bunyaad rakhi) Abdul Malik ne us ko jawab likha ke hamein bin Zubair raziyallahu anhu ki taghayyur o tabaddul se kuch kaam nahi (tum aisa karo ke) jo unhon ne tool mein zyada kar diya hai wo rehnay do aur jo Hateem ki taraf se zyada kiya hai us ko nikaal daalo aur phir haalat oola par bana do aur wo darwaza band kar do jo ke unhon ne zyada khola hai gharz Hajjaj ne usay tor kar binaye (bunyaad) awwal par bana diya"
"772","[AI-translation] ´Abu Qaza se riwayat hai ke` Abdul Malik bin Marwan bait Allah ka tawaaf kar raha tha aur us ne kaha ke Allah Taala bin Zubair raziyallahu anhu ko halaak karay ke wo Aisha (raziyallahu anha) par jhoot baandhta tha aur kehta tha ke mein ne un ko kehtay hue suna hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Ae Aisha ! agar tumhari qaum ne naya naya kufr na chhora hota to mein Kaaba ko tor kar us mein Hijr (Hateem) ka izafa kar deta us liye ke tumhari qaum ne Kaaba ki imaarat mein kami kar di hai (ye sun kar) Haris ne kaha ke Ae Ameer-ul-Momineen ! aisa na keye us liye ke mein ne bhi Umm ul-Momineen raziyallahu anha se suna hai ke wo ye hadees bayan karti thin to Abdul Malik ne kaha ke agar Kaaba giranay se pehle mein ye hadees sunta to bin Zubair raziyallahu anhu hi ki bunyaad ko qaim rakhta"
"773","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Zaid bin Aasim raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ibrahim alaihissalam ne Makka ka haram muqarrar kiya (yani us ki hurmat zaahir ki warna us ki hurmat aasmaan o zameen ke binnay ke din se thi) aur us ke logon ke liye dua ki aur mein Madina ko hurmat wala banata hun jaisay Ibrahim alaihissalam ne Makka ko hurmat wala kiya aur mein ne Madina ke sa aur mudd ke liye dua ki us ki do misl jo Ibrahim alaihissalam ne ahl Makka ke liye dua ki thi"
"774","[AI-translation] ´Fateh-e-Iran Sa'd bin Abu Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mein donon kaalay patharon ke darmiyan ki jagah ko haram muqarrar karta hun ke wahan ka kaantay daar darakht na kaata jaye aur na wahan shikaar maara jaye aur farmaya ke Madina un ke liye behtar hai Kaash wo us ko samajhtay (ye Khattab hai un logon ko jo Madina chhor kar aur jagah chalay jatay hain ya tamam Musalmanon ko) aur koi Madina ki sukoonat i'raaz kar ke nahi chhorta magar Allah Taala us se behtar koi aadmi us mein bhej deta hai aur nahi koi sabr karta us ki bhook pyaas aur mehnat o mashaqqat par magar mein qayamat ke din us ka shafee ya gawah hun ga"
"775","[AI-translation] ´Amir bin Sa'd se riwayat hai ke` Sa'd raziyallahu anhu apne makaan ko chalay jo Aqeeq mein tha ke (rastay mein) aik ghulam ko dekha jo aik darakht kaat raha tha ya pattay tor raha tha to us ka samaan chheen liya jab Sa'd wapas aaye to us ke ghar walay aaye aur unhon ne kaha ke Aap wo us ko pher dijiye ya hamein inayat kijiye to unhon ne kaha : us baat se Allah ki panah ke mein wo cheez pher dun jo mujhe Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne batreeq inaam inayat ki hai aur unhon ne us ka samaan wapas karnay se inkar kar diya"
"776","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Ae Allah ! Madina mein Makka se dogni barkat de"
"777","[AI-translation] ´Ibrahim Taimi apne walid se riwayat kartay hain ke` unhon ne kaha ke ham par Ali bin Abu Talib (raziyallahu anhu) ne khutba padha aur kaha ke jo koi daawa karay ke hamaray paas (yani ahl bait ke paas) kitab Allah aur us saheefa rawi ne kaha ke saheefa un ki talwaar ke miyaan mein latka hua tha ke siwa koi aur cheez hai to us ne jhoot kaha aur us saheefa mein oonton ki Umaron (zakaat ke muta'alliqaat) aur kuch zakhmon ka bayan hai (yani qisaas aur diyyaton ka bayan) aur us saheefa mein ye bhi hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Madina ka Jabal Ayr se Jabal Saur tak ka ilaaqa haram hai pas jo shakhs Madina mein koi nayi baat yani bidat nikalay ya nayi baat nikaalnay walay ko yani bidati ko jagah de to us par Allah Taala ki lanat hai aur farishton ki aur sab logon ki bhi Allah Taala us ka na koi farz qabool karay ga aur na sunnat aur amaan dena har Musalman ka barabar hai ke adna Musalman ki panah denay ka bhi aitbaar kiya jata hai aur jis ne apne Aap ko apne baap ke siwa kisi ghair ka farzand theharaya ya apne aaqaon ke siwa kisi doosray ka ghulam apne Aap ko qarar diya to us par bhi Allah Taala farishton aur sab logon ki lanat hai aur Allah Taala qayamat ke din us ka na koi farz qabool karay ga aur na koi sunnat (* yahan ” hadas “ se muraad koi bhi jurm hai aur us mein ye (baat yani bidat) bhi shaamil hai)"
"778","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas pehla phal aata to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam dua kartay ke Ae Allah ! hamaray sheher mein aur hamaray phalon mein aur hamaray Madina mein aur hamaray mudd aur sa mein barkat dar barkat farma phir wo phal (majlis mein) maujood bachon mein se sab se chotay bachay ko de detay"
"779","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed maula mahari se riwayat hai ke` wo Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas Harra ki raaton mein aaye (yani jin dinon Madina tayyiba mein aik fitna mashhoor hua tha aur zaalimon ne Madina ko lota tha) aur un se mashwara kiya ke Madina se kahein aur chalay jayein aur un se wahan ki giraani nirkh (mehengaayi) aur kasrat ayaal ki shikayat ki aur khabar di ke mujhe Madina ki mehnat aur bhook par sabr nahi aa sakta to Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke teri kharaabi ho mein tujhe us ka mashwara nahi dun ga (kyunke) mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna hai ke wo farmatay thay ke koi shakhs yahan ki takleefon par sabr nahi karta aur phir mar jata hai magar ye ke mein qayamat ke din us ka shafee ya gawah hun ga agar wo Musalman ho"
"780","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` jab ham Madina mein (hijrat kar ke) aaye to wahan wabayi bukhar phaila hua tha aur Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) aur Bilal raziyallahu anhu beemar ho gaye phir jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apne ashaab ki beemari dekhi to dua ki ke Ae Allah ! hamaray Madina ko hamaray liye dost kar de jaisay to ne Makka ko dost kiya tha ya us se bhi zyada aur us ko sehat ki jagah bana de aur hamein us ke ” sa “ aur ” mudd “ mein barkat de aur us ke bukhar ko Johfa ki taraf pher de"
"781","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Madina ke naakon par farishtay muqarrar hain us mein taa'oon aur Dajjal nahi aa sakta"
"782","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : aik waqt logon par aisa aaye ga ke aadmi apne bhatijay aur apne qaraabat walay ko pukaaray ga ke khushhaali ke mulk mein khushhaali ke mulk mein challu halanke Madina un ke liye behtar ho ga Kaash ke wo jantay hotay aur qasam hai us Rab ki ke meri jaan us ke haath mein hai ke koi shakhs Madina se bezaar ho kar nahi nikalta magar Allah Taala us se behtar doosra shakhs Madina mein bhej deta hai aagaah raho ke Madina lohaar ki bhatti ki manind hai ke wo meel ko nikaal deta hai aur qayamat qaim na ho gi jab tak ke Madina apne shareer logon ko nikaal na de ga jaisay ke bhatti lohay ki meel ko nikaal deti hai"
"783","[AI-translation] ´Jabir bin Samura (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko ye farmatay hue suna ke Allah Jal Jalaluhu ne Madina ka naam Taaba (tayyiba) rakha hai"
"784","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke jo us sheher (yani Madina) walon ki burayi ka irada karta hai to Allah Taala us ko aisa ghula deta hai jaisay namak pani mein ghul jata hai"
"785","[AI-translation] ´Sufyan bin Abu Zuhair raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke Yaman fatah ho ga to kuch log Madina se apne oonton ko haanktay hue apne ghar walon aur khuddaam ke saath niklein ge halanke Madina un ke liye behtar ho ga Kaash wo jantay hotay phir shaam fatah ho ga aur Madina ki aik qaum apne ghar walon aur khuddaam ke saath oonton ko haanktay hue niklay gi aur Madina un ke liye behtar ho ga Kaash wo jantay phir Iraq fatah ho ga aur Madina ki aik qaum apne ghar walon aur khuddaam ke saath apne oonton ko haanktay hue niklay gi halanke Madina un ke haq mein behtar ho ga Kaash wo jantay"
"786","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke log Madina ko us ke khair honay ke bawajood chhor dein ge aur us mein koi na rahay ga siwae darindon aur parindon ke phir qabeela Mazina se do charwahay apni bakriyon ko pukaartay hue Madina (janay) ka irada kartay hue niklein ge aur wo Madina ko veeraan payein ge yahan tak ke jab Saniya al-Wida tak pahunchein ge to apne munh ke bal gir parein ge"
"787","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : mere ghar aur mimbar ke darmiyan mein jannat ki kiyaariyon mein se aik kiyaari hai aur mera mimbar mere hauz par hai"
"788","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Uhud (pahar) ki taraf dekha aur farmaya ke Uhud aisa pahar hai ke wo hamein dost rakhta hai aur ham us ko dost rakhtay hain"
"789","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke kijaaway na baandhay jayein (safar na kiya jaye) magar teen masjidon ki taraf aik meri ye masjid (yani jo Madina mein hai Masjid-e-Nabawi) aur Masjid-ul-Haram aur Masjid-ul-Aqsa (yani bait Bait-ul-Maqdis)"
"790","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : meri us masjid (Masjid-e-Nabawi) mein aik namaz padhna doosri masjidon mein hazaar namazein padhnay se afzal hai siwae Masjid-ul-Haram ke"
"791","[AI-translation] ´Salama bin Abdur Rahman kehtay hain ke` mere paas se Abdur Rahman bin Abu Sa'eed Khudri raziyallahu anhu guzray to mein ne un se kaha ke Aap ne apne walid (Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu)) ko kaisay suna jo wo us masjid ke mutaliq farmatay thay ke jis ki bunyaad taqwa par rakhi gayi hai unhon ne kaha ke mere walid raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki biwion mein se kisi ke ghar mein daakhil hua aur mein ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! wo kaun si masjid hai jis ke baaray mein Allah Taala farmata hai ke us ki bunyaad taqwa par rakhi gayi hai bayan kartay hain ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aik mutthi kankar le kar zameen par maaray aur farmaya ke wo yehi tumhari Madina ki masjid hai (Salama bin Abdur Rahman) mein ne kaha ke mein bhi gawahi deta hun ke mein ne bhi tumharay walid raziyallahu anhu se suna hai (ke us masjid ka) aisa hi zikr kiya kartay thay"
"792","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam masjid qaba ko paidal bhi aur sawaar bhi tashreef laya kartay thay aur us mein do rakat namaz ada kartay thay"
"793","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke` wo (bin Umar) har hafta ke din (masjid) qaba mein aatay thay aur kehtay thay ke mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko har hafta ke din qaba jatay hue dekha hai"
